(573078, 59125, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract idea - let down, for me, but the fact that the over-exposure of the sun-spots makes them <i>all</i> llok out of focus, rather than moving through the plane of focus. I think I''d have exposed for the bright spots, and tried to use levels or curves to bring back the un-lit surface of the seat.</td>', 'Interesting abstract idea - let down, for me, but the fact that the over-exposure of the sun-spots makes them all llok out of focus, rather than moving through the plane of focus. I think I''d have exposed for the bright spots, and tried to use levels or curves to bring back the un-lit surface of the seat.', '2004-02-09 06:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
