(573213, 59110, 5391, '<td valign="top">Technically very well done - good job of handling those refelctions on the chrome so you didn''t have any distracting elements.  Lovely saturated colors, good composition and exposure.  Congrats on a shot well done.</td>', 'Technically very well done - good job of handling those refelctions on the chrome so you didn''t have any distracting elements.  Lovely saturated colors, good composition and exposure.  Congrats on a shot well done.', '2004-02-09 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
