(573219, 59196, 8139, '<td valign="top">Artistic. I like the composition and color. Fits well the challenge.<br/>Just a problem with the border, too small? or unnecessary? or maybe a 1 pixel white border between the photo and the black border (could be a blue one)?<br/>Good picture anyway. 8</td>', 'Artistic. I like the composition and color. Fits well the challenge.Just a problem with the border, too small? or unnecessary? or maybe a 1 pixel white border between the photo and the black border (could be a blue one)?Good picture anyway. 8', '2004-02-09 09:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(573220, 59067, 5391, '<td valign="top">I love the way the sharpness of the red flower stands out against the blue - it grabs your eye and plays with it almost like an optical illusion.  Nice composition, also.  The colors are perhaps almost so saturated that I think you''ve lost some detail in the reds, but overall a very interesting, eye-catching shot.</td>', 'I love the way the sharpness of the red flower stands out against the blue - it grabs your eye and plays with it almost like an optical illusion.  Nice composition, also.  The colors are perhaps almost so saturated that I think you''ve lost some detail in the reds, but overall a very interesting, eye-catching shot.', '2004-02-09 09:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(573221, 59157, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - amazing sharpness.  I''d like to see other plays on the composition, perhaps.  The flowers seem a little more centered than desirable, though perhaps since they are different heights, that makes a difference.  A lovely shot, either way, worthy of being on a postcard or some such.</td>', 'Beautiful shot - amazing sharpness.  I''d like to see other plays on the composition, perhaps.  The flowers seem a little more centered than desirable, though perhaps since they are different heights, that makes a difference.  A lovely shot, either way, worthy of being on a postcard or some such.', '2004-02-09 09:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(573222, 58894, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this with the camera lens a little closer to the red block to really play on the depth-of-field and throw the other two even more out of focus.  Good choice in objects, though - the color and shape difference really work well with the theme in bringing one specific object to the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'I''d like to see this with the camera lens a little closer to the red block to really play on the depth-of-field and throw the other two even more out of focus.  Good choice in objects, though - the color and shape difference really work well with the theme in bringing one specific object to the viewer''s attention.', '2004-02-09 09:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(573223, 58945, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract - great composition and exposure to really whiten that white background.  I like this very much.  7</td>', 'Very interesting abstract - great composition and exposure to really whiten that white background.  I like this very much.  7', '2004-02-09 09:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(573225, 58852, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition - I love the blue sky.  This would be highly appropriate for advertising with all of that lovely blue text space.  Perhaps a big high-contrast for my taste, but overall very nice.</td>', 'Very nice composition - I love the blue sky.  This would be highly appropriate for advertising with all of that lovely blue text space.  Perhaps a big high-contrast for my taste, but overall very nice.', '2004-02-09 09:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(573227, 59042, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept, well-executed.</td>', 'Very nice concept, well-executed.', '2004-02-09 09:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(573229, 58960, 5391, '<td valign="top">Interesting object with interesting texture.  Nice warm colors.  It might be more interesting to have similar objects in the background, thrown completely out of focus, to really illustrate the limited depth of field.</td>', 'Interesting object with interesting texture.  Nice warm colors.  It might be more interesting to have similar objects in the background, thrown completely out of focus, to really illustrate the limited depth of field.', '2004-02-09 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(573233, 59081, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice, simple, well-exposed and composed photograph.  Illustrates the challenge theme very nicely.</td>', 'Very nice, simple, well-exposed and composed photograph.  Illustrates the challenge theme very nicely.', '2004-02-09 10:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(573235, 58554, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract with very eye-pleasing lighting.  Great composition, too - the leading lines take your eye all the way through every detail of the texture.  9</td>', 'Beautiful abstract with very eye-pleasing lighting.  Great composition, too - the leading lines take your eye all the way through every detail of the texture.  9', '2004-02-09 10:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(573240, 58675, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, interesting shot.  Nice graphic composition, great detail - illustrates the challenge theme very well.  Love the colors and textures.  9</td>', 'Beautiful, interesting shot.  Nice graphic composition, great detail - illustrates the challenge theme very well.  Love the colors and textures.  9', '2004-02-09 10:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(573243, 58941, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - I anticipate this doing VERY well in the challenge.  Great capture, perfect timing and exposure, fits the challenge very well.  Great work!  9</td>', 'Wow - I anticipate this doing VERY well in the challenge.  Great capture, perfect timing and exposure, fits the challenge very well.  Great work!  9', '2004-02-09 10:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(573249, 59137, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  This would do very well as a stock photography image.  Crisp, clear, and the composition is very dynamic - that streak of white in the background really keeps your eye going back to the end of the cable that is the focus of the photograph.  Congrats!  10</td>', 'Beautiful.  This would do very well as a stock photography image.  Crisp, clear, and the composition is very dynamic - that streak of white in the background really keeps your eye going back to the end of the cable that is the focus of the photograph.  Congrats!  10', '2004-02-09 10:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(573253, 59103, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I''ve always wanted to try something like this - you''ve done it very well.  The yellows are a bit saturated and you''ve lost some detail in your main fish due to that, but overall very nice.  The background pattern made by the out of focus fish is just beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I''ve always wanted to try something like this - you''ve done it very well.  The yellows are a bit saturated and you''ve lost some detail in your main fish due to that, but overall very nice.  The background pattern made by the out of focus fish is just beautiful.', '2004-02-09 10:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(573256, 58852, 13136, '<td valign="top">Seems like there should be more of the background as ground instead of sky. Still a nice shot.</td>', 'Seems like there should be more of the background as ground instead of sky. Still a nice shot.', '2004-02-09 10:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(573259, 59259, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nesting dolls was a good idea for this challenge.</td>', 'Nesting dolls was a good idea for this challenge.', '2004-02-09 10:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(573260, 58491, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract image.  Good, creative use of depth of field to bring a feeling of chaos and a busy feeling to the photograph.  Would work well as a background in the land of stock photography.  8</td>', 'Very interesting abstract image.  Good, creative use of depth of field to bring a feeling of chaos and a busy feeling to the photograph.  Would work well as a background in the land of stock photography.  8', '2004-02-09 10:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(573264, 59132, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - I see this doing very well in the challenge.  Water drops are always so amazing for the eye to see when captured this clearly, and the waves of red in the background formed by the rose are a perfect balance to the composition.  Well-composed, exposed and overall executed.  Would make a fantastic greeting card.  10</td>', 'Wow - I see this doing very well in the challenge.  Water drops are always so amazing for the eye to see when captured this clearly, and the waves of red in the background formed by the rose are a perfect balance to the composition.  Well-composed, exposed and overall executed.  Would make a fantastic greeting card.  10', '2004-02-09 10:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(573272, 58640, 5391, '<td valign="top">An image similar to many we''ve seen time and again, but that doesn''t stop it from being executed in a perfect manner.  Beautiful image.  10</td>', 'An image similar to many we''ve seen time and again, but that doesn''t stop it from being executed in a perfect manner.  Beautiful image.  10', '2004-02-09 10:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(573275, 59127, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooooh! Love this! Just wonderfully wonderfully representative of shallow DOF and also a fantastically composed and balanced image. The tip of that screw seems rather oversharpened but I think that actually it might just be that there is a lot of detailed pattern reflected in the surface there rather than smooth colour. I really like this one a lot, and were I someone who felt it worthwhile paying for postage from DPC Prints I''d buy this one. <br/>:oP</td>', 'Oooooh! Love this! Just wonderfully wonderfully representative of shallow DOF and also a fantastically composed and balanced image. The tip of that screw seems rather oversharpened but I think that actually it might just be that there is a lot of detailed pattern reflected in the surface there rather than smooth colour. I really like this one a lot, and were I someone who felt it worthwhile paying for postage from DPC Prints I''d buy this one. :oP', '2004-02-09 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(573276, 58555, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifull composed - I love the angle of the zipper pull and the "topography" of the leather. Black and white really allows the excellent use of lighting to stand out. A great image.</td>', 'Beautifull composed - I love the angle of the zipper pull and the "topography" of the leather. Black and white really allows the excellent use of lighting to stand out. A great image.', '2004-02-09 10:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(573278, 58640, 8229, '<td valign="top">like this a lot. great show of shallow dOF</td>', 'like this a lot. great show of shallow dOF', '2004-02-09 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(573281, 59085, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual viewpoint here - shows such a different perspective. Although the meat gives a wonderful rich colour against the black, white and grey of dog and paving, I don''t know that it''s the most appealing foreground subject - and I quite like the look and feel of raw meat. Wonder whether a doggie biscuit would have made a good alternative or whether the lack of vibrant colour would have made it too dull? Anyway, this one has certainly made me think about the image.</td>', 'I like the unusual viewpoint here - shows such a different perspective. Although the meat gives a wonderful rich colour against the black, white and grey of dog and paving, I don''t know that it''s the most appealing foreground subject - and I quite like the look and feel of raw meat. Wonder whether a doggie biscuit would have made a good alternative or whether the lack of vibrant colour would have made it too dull? Anyway, this one has certainly made me think about the image.', '2004-02-09 10:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(573287, 59058, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful compostion!  Very well toned, I like the choice of B&amp;W but also leaves me wondering what the color version was like.  Excellent take on the challenge! 8</td>', 'Beautiful compostion!  Very well toned, I like the choice of B&W but also leaves me wondering what the color version was like.  Excellent take on the challenge! 8', '2004-02-09 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(573289, 58650, 7086, '<td valign="top">Peerless as a portrait, unfortunately doesn''t work that well as an example of shallow DOF, more colour in the coat (where the shallowness is apparent) may have helped.</td>', 'Peerless as a portrait, unfortunately doesn''t work that well as an example of shallow DOF, more colour in the coat (where the shallowness is apparent) may have helped.', '2004-02-09 10:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(573290, 58959, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and I really like the pose you chose.  Very nice composition, well done!</td>', 'Great lighting and I really like the pose you chose.  Very nice composition, well done!', '2004-02-09 10:49:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(573292, 59216, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful - I love the way you''ve shown that even something considered dead or dying has a beauty of it''s own.</td>', 'This is beautiful - I love the way you''ve shown that even something considered dead or dying has a beauty of it''s own.', '2004-02-09 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(573294, 59132, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, that''s about all I can say. :)  Wonderful subject and great focus!</td>', 'Beautiful, that''s about all I can say. :)  Wonderful subject and great focus!', '2004-02-09 10:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(573295, 59085, 14620, '<td valign="top">Too Damn cute!!  OK, well the meat looks a little gross :), but the concept is great.  LOVE the dogs pose, even though you can''t see his face you can get the feel of what he wants.</td>', 'Too Damn cute!!  OK, well the meat looks a little gross :), but the concept is great.  LOVE the dogs pose, even though you can''t see his face you can get the feel of what he wants.', '2004-02-09 10:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(573296, 59307, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative and wonderful use of DOF.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very imaginative and wonderful use of DOF.  One of my favorites.', '2004-02-09 10:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(573297, 59301, 3087, '<td valign="top">I quite like the strong orange tone but I am not so keen on composition. Although I like the diagonal of the cable, I think the head is too close to the top edge of the frame and not well positioned horizontally. I find the position of the other cables somewhat messy and not adding to composition in any way.</td>', 'I quite like the strong orange tone but I am not so keen on composition. Although I like the diagonal of the cable, I think the head is too close to the top edge of the frame and not well positioned horizontally. I find the position of the other cables somewhat messy and not adding to composition in any way.', '2004-02-09 10:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(573299, 59090, 14620, '<td valign="top">I really like the compostion you chose here.  Makes for an interesting photo, I might have carried the coins all the way to the back of the photo kind of seems unfinished in the back.  But overall an excellent shot for this challenge!</td>', 'I really like the compostion you chose here.  Makes for an interesting photo, I might have carried the coins all the way to the back of the photo kind of seems unfinished in the back.  But overall an excellent shot for this challenge!', '2004-02-09 10:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(573300, 58944, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so very pretty and serene.  I like the color choices you''ve made and the flower is just perfect.  Very good job.</td>', 'This is so very pretty and serene.  I like the color choices you''ve made and the flower is just perfect.  Very good job.', '2004-02-09 10:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(573301, 59137, 3087, '<td valign="top">Vibrant background colour really lifts this image. I like the jagged white lines in the background too.</td>', 'Vibrant background colour really lifts this image. I like the jagged white lines in the background too.', '2004-02-09 10:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(573302, 58899, 13136, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I''m sorry, but I don''t see the ''Shallow DOF'' here.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I''m sorry, but I don''t see the ''Shallow DOF'' here.', '2004-02-09 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(573304, 59058, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image - the lighting is flattering to the skin tones and the composition is really unusual.<br/>I''m not sure I like the inclusion of the hair - I think either more or none would work better in terms of composition, for me. And, although I like the texture and stripes of the cloth on her body, it feels a little too neatly folded and placed - I wonder if it would be more interesting with a few folds in it?<br/>Altogether a wonderful image.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image - the lighting is flattering to the skin tones and the composition is really unusual.I''m not sure I like the inclusion of the hair - I think either more or none would work better in terms of composition, for me. And, although I like the texture and stripes of the cloth on her body, it feels a little too neatly folded and placed - I wonder if it would be more interesting with a few folds in it?Altogether a wonderful image.', '2004-02-09 10:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(573305, 59217, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF shot of the bird. The frame and tilt of the picture don''t really work for me. Makes it look gimmicky.</td>', 'Nice DOF shot of the bird. The frame and tilt of the picture don''t really work for me. Makes it look gimmicky.', '2004-02-09 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(573309, 59081, 16957, '<td valign="top">Simple but elegant pic of an icon of design.</td>', 'Simple but elegant pic of an icon of design.', '2004-02-09 11:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(573314, 59249, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour. I like the strong lighting - it makes it more abstract somehow.</td>', 'Great use of colour. I like the strong lighting - it makes it more abstract somehow.', '2004-02-09 11:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(573334, 58898, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and the droplet detail is great. I think I''d prefer the straw to push further into the frame in terms of composition. Even though the droplet is centred it feels kind of oddly balanced because the straw adds more weight to one side. For that reason I''d not opt for the centred composition and go for a two thirds/ one third instead. Just my preference.</td>', 'Lovely colours and the droplet detail is great. I think I''d prefer the straw to push further into the frame in terms of composition. Even though the droplet is centred it feels kind of oddly balanced because the straw adds more weight to one side. For that reason I''d not opt for the centred composition and go for a two thirds/ one third instead. Just my preference.', '2004-02-09 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(573335, 58852, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the expanse of sky to express the emptiness of the landscape.</td>', 'I like the use of the expanse of sky to express the emptiness of the landscape.', '2004-02-09 11:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(573340, 58949, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great composition with the opposing diagonals. Colour seems too orangey to me.</td>', 'Great composition with the opposing diagonals. Colour seems too orangey to me.', '2004-02-09 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(573347, 59288, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like or understand the choice of such a strong red colour but I like the image and the way one lone nut stands out.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like or understand the choice of such a strong red colour but I like the image and the way one lone nut stands out.', '2004-02-09 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(573348, 58473, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image - it''s the equivalent of reading a fairytale in image format...</td>', 'What a beautiful image - it''s the equivalent of reading a fairytale in image format...', '2004-02-09 11:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(573350, 58899, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image - great composition, strongly conveys a sense of mood. Doesn''t strike me as shallow DOF.</td>', 'A beautiful image - great composition, strongly conveys a sense of mood. Doesn''t strike me as shallow DOF.', '2004-02-09 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(573352, 58672, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of repetition resulting in a really quirky image. Doesn''t seem to be a very shallow DOF here though.</td>', 'Great use of repetition resulting in a really quirky image. Doesn''t seem to be a very shallow DOF here though.', '2004-02-09 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(573355, 58945, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great example of shallow DOF - what wonderful organic curves and twists.</td>', 'A great example of shallow DOF - what wonderful organic curves and twists.', '2004-02-09 11:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(573357, 58944, 11843, '<td valign="top">my favorite color - blue<br/>good dof</td>', 'my favorite color - bluegood dof', '2004-02-09 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(573358, 59030, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting! This is a really lovely image - the kind of image where content itself doesn''t matter - the end result is visually appealing because of the light/ shade/ form/ lighting and not because of the choice of content.</td>', 'Lovely lighting! This is a really lovely image - the kind of image where content itself doesn''t matter - the end result is visually appealing because of the light/ shade/ form/ lighting and not because of the choice of content.', '2004-02-09 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(573359, 58924, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way the shallow DOF reduces the balls in the background to an abstract jumble of colours.</td>', 'I like the way the shallow DOF reduces the balls in the background to an abstract jumble of colours.', '2004-02-09 11:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(573360, 59102, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot - I love extremely shallow DOF. In this case I love your choice of background colour - the pencil really fades into it i such a fascinating way. One of my favourite 3 or 4 of this challenge.</td>', 'I really like this a lot - I love extremely shallow DOF. In this case I love your choice of background colour - the pencil really fades into it i such a fascinating way. One of my favourite 3 or 4 of this challenge.', '2004-02-09 11:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(573363, 59011, 11843, '<td valign="top">took me awhile to figure out what the object was, until I read the sheet music.<br/>I wonder how it would have looked if a Valve was in focus instead of the sheet music</td>', 'took me awhile to figure out what the object was, until I read the sheet music.I wonder how it would have looked if a Valve was in focus instead of the sheet music', '2004-02-09 11:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(573364, 59247, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colours. Simple but effective composition. Good choice of flower as the long stem-like thingies really work in a shallow DOF image.</td>', 'Very vibrant colours. Simple but effective composition. Good choice of flower as the long stem-like thingies really work in a shallow DOF image.', '2004-02-09 11:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(573368, 59253, 11843, '<td valign="top">Be that Heduk?????? No23. Go Av''s!!!!</td>', 'Be that Heduk?????? No23. Go Av''s!!!!', '2004-02-09 11:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(573375, 58640, 9941, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this same sort of photo in nearly every challenge.  You did a great job, and I''m giving you an 8.  Still, this shot is becoming a cliche''.</td>', 'I''ve seen this same sort of photo in nearly every challenge.  You did a great job, and I''m giving you an 8.  Still, this shot is becoming a cliche''.', '2004-02-09 12:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(573377, 59021, 9941, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  One of the few shots I''ve seen here that actually shows a person doing something.  10.</td>', 'Very nice!  One of the few shots I''ve seen here that actually shows a person doing something.  10.', '2004-02-09 12:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(573388, 59030, 14614, '<td valign="top">The sepia treatment enhances your composition... like the placement of the infocus part and the squiggle part</td>', 'The sepia treatment enhances your composition... like the placement of the infocus part and the squiggle part', '2004-02-09 12:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(573389, 59067, 14614, '<td valign="top">punchy colors and good placement of the in focus part</td>', 'punchy colors and good placement of the in focus part', '2004-02-09 12:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(573390, 58736, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice example of shallow DOF and the diagonal does add interest to the composition. Two negatives from my point of view - one is that the subject matter just isn''t hugely interesting and two is that the top left corner of the frame feels too tight - by that I mean that the subject matter - the gulls - are too close to the edges of the frame.</td>', 'A nice example of shallow DOF and the diagonal does add interest to the composition. Two negatives from my point of view - one is that the subject matter just isn''t hugely interesting and two is that the top left corner of the frame feels too tight - by that I mean that the subject matter - the gulls - are too close to the edges of the frame.', '2004-02-09 12:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(573391, 58987, 14614, '<td valign="top">A little more light in the foreground would have helped me see your full composition better.</td>', 'A little more light in the foreground would have helped me see your full composition better.', '2004-02-09 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(573392, 58661, 14614, '<td valign="top">I would like a bit more light on one/all of the roses</td>', 'I would like a bit more light on one/all of the roses', '2004-02-09 12:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(573394, 58925, 14614, '<td valign="top">good use of the rule of threes.  small nit but the yellow dot in lower right distracts from a well lit shot</td>', 'good use of the rule of threes.  small nit but the yellow dot in lower right distracts from a well lit shot', '2004-02-09 12:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(573396, 59290, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice use of dof to show the pattern break.  like the rusty lances.  stuff in background could be a bit darker (distracting as lit)</td>', 'nice use of dof to show the pattern break.  like the rusty lances.  stuff in background could be a bit darker (distracting as lit)', '2004-02-09 12:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
