(573426, 59031, 327, '<td valign="top">Two heads are better then one. :) Cute find. Focus is a bit soft...looks like it was a cold maybe windy day..? Must of been camera movement.</td>', 'Two heads are better then one. :) Cute find. Focus is a bit soft...looks like it was a cold maybe windy day..? Must of been camera movement.', '2004-02-09 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
