(573428, 59061, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one is perfect for this challenge. You really used shallow DOF to isolate the butterfly. Plus, I really like the composition.</td>', 'This one is perfect for this challenge. You really used shallow DOF to isolate the butterfly. Plus, I really like the composition.', '2004-02-09 12:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(573429, 59067, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It''s very simple and a great use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'I really like this. It''s very simple and a great use of shallow DOF.', '2004-02-09 12:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(573430, 58861, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful image. I really like the composition and the colours. Great choice to use a black background.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful image. I really like the composition and the colours. Great choice to use a black background.', '2004-02-09 12:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(573431, 58524, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really great capture. I really like the use of shallow DOF here. I know from experience it can be difficult to get a 640 pixel-wide image and maintain sharpness, but you may find your scores will be higher if you include a larger photo size next time. Good luck with this one. It''s very nice.</td>', 'This is a really great capture. I really like the use of shallow DOF here. I know from experience it can be difficult to get a 640 pixel-wide image and maintain sharpness, but you may find your scores will be higher if you include a larger photo size next time. Good luck with this one. It''s very nice.', '2004-02-09 12:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(573433, 58672, 15207, '<td valign="top">All I can say is WOW! This is such a beautiful black and white. The symmetry is incredible and I love the blankets of snow. Good luck with this one.</td>', 'All I can say is WOW! This is such a beautiful black and white. The symmetry is incredible and I love the blankets of snow. Good luck with this one.', '2004-02-09 12:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
