(573584, 59027, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject, another very nice valentine"esque" photo.  The colors are wonderful, the composition is nice but it does seem a little off -center, but not off-center enough  to be considered an off-center shot (can I say off-center one more time?)  and though the horizon (table) seems level the picture kind of has a tilted feel to it, perhaps the cake is a little lopsided, in which case that would be the bakers fault and not yours. :-)  Overall I''d say this is a very romantic photo.</td>', 'Beautiful subject, another very nice valentine"esque" photo.  The colors are wonderful, the composition is nice but it does seem a little off -center, but not off-center enough  to be considered an off-center shot (can I say off-center one more time?)  and though the horizon (table) seems level the picture kind of has a tilted feel to it, perhaps the cake is a little lopsided, in which case that would be the bakers fault and not yours. :-)  Overall I''d say this is a very romantic photo.', '2004-02-09 15:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
