(573759, 59262, 772, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field works here, but the lighting seems to be creating something that doesn''t appeal to me visually.</td>', 'The shallow depth of field works here, but the lighting seems to be creating something that doesn''t appeal to me visually.', '2004-02-09 18:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
