(574030, 59269, 8624, '<td valign="top">very nice composition. I like your foxus being on the hook. the reel blurred in the background adds nicely to the balance of the image and provides good context. I wish your tones we a little better though, with the whites being brighter, but I''d still give it an 8. well done.</td>', 'very nice composition. I like your foxus being on the hook. the reel blurred in the background adds nicely to the balance of the image and provides good context. I wish your tones we a little better though, with the whites being brighter, but I''d still give it an 8. well done.', '2004-02-09 22:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(574031, 59225, 12674, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Might also be interesting to focus on surface of the water in the pitcher.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Might also be interesting to focus on surface of the water in the pitcher.', '2004-02-09 22:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(574032, 58899, 13728, '<td valign="top">I truly love this shot, but I don''t think it realy fits in the shallow depth a field area.  Landscape like this is really hard to control the DOF in, because mostly you are shooting a infinity</td>', 'I truly love this shot, but I don''t think it realy fits in the shallow depth a field area.  Landscape like this is really hard to control the DOF in, because mostly you are shooting a infinity', '2004-02-09 22:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(574033, 58675, 8624, '<td valign="top">great macro- I''d have never guessed without the title. excellent capture of the texture of the matchheads and good abstract interpretation of the assignment.</td>', 'great macro- I''d have never guessed without the title. excellent capture of the texture of the matchheads and good abstract interpretation of the assignment.', '2004-02-09 22:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(574040, 58524, 13728, '<td valign="top">This looks like such a lovely shot, but it is posted so small it is very hard to see.  Too bad because I think that will hurt this shot in voting</td>', 'This looks like such a lovely shot, but it is posted so small it is very hard to see.  Too bad because I think that will hurt this shot in voting', '2004-02-09 22:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
