(574050, 58302, 8624, '<td valign="top">stunning portrait. she draws you right in with her eyes. I like the angle of her pose. There is a distracting hair running across her cheek and chin and over her chest, though. 8</td>', 'stunning portrait. she draws you right in with her eyes. I like the angle of her pose. There is a distracting hair running across her cheek and chin and over her chest, though. 8', '2004-02-09 22:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
