(574437, 59115, 12108, '<td valign="top">the blur on the back glasses is a little distracting. If it had been still this would have been a great shot. (5)</td>', 'the blur on the back glasses is a little distracting. If it had been still this would have been a great shot. (5)', '2004-02-10 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(574439, 58672, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love this image! The clarity of the three benches nicely contrasts with the blurry souroundings. The tones are deep and stunning.</td>', 'I love this image! The clarity of the three benches nicely contrasts with the blurry souroundings. The tones are deep and stunning.', '2004-02-10 11:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(574440, 59085, 9252, '<td valign="top">Excellent! If I could vote, I''d give it a 10!</td>', 'Excellent! If I could vote, I''d give it a 10!', '2004-02-10 11:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(574443, 59085, 179, '<td valign="top">This one just cracks me up! One of those photos that turns a "grey day" into a "giggle day". Original. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'This one just cracks me up! One of those photos that turns a "grey day" into a "giggle day". Original. Well done and good luck!', '2004-02-10 11:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(574444, 59259, 12108, '<td valign="top">The light seems to bee a little to bright on the dolls other then that great shot.<br/>(7)</td>', 'The light seems to bee a little to bright on the dolls other then that great shot.(7)', '2004-02-10 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(574447, 58925, 12108, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, Almost used the same idea but was going to focus on the 10 as a message. (10)</td>', 'Nice shot, Almost used the same idea but was going to focus on the 10 as a message. (10)', '2004-02-10 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(574448, 58626, 12108, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, would have like to see a littme more light on the purple to bring out the color (7)</td>', 'Nice colors, would have like to see a littme more light on the purple to bring out the color (7)', '2004-02-10 11:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(574451, 59036, 12108, '<td valign="top">The trophies seem to be leaning a little to the left. (6)</td>', 'The trophies seem to be leaning a little to the left. (6)', '2004-02-10 11:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(574459, 58840, 12108, '<td valign="top">Good work getting this layed out (7)<br/>was it your intention to have the scrabble box upside down?</td>', 'Good work getting this layed out (7)was it your intention to have the scrabble box upside down?', '2004-02-10 11:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(574466, 59269, 12108, '<td valign="top">I like the red in this shot, good work (9)</td>', 'I like the red in this shot, good work (9)', '2004-02-10 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(574468, 59303, 12108, '<td valign="top">Very creative, will be interested to see what you used to do this with (8)</td>', 'Very creative, will be interested to see what you used to do this with (8)', '2004-02-10 11:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(574489, 59217, 14453, '<td valign="top">The frame is.... Distrubing!! But original!</td>', 'The frame is.... Distrubing!! But original!', '2004-02-10 11:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(574501, 58524, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used shallow depth of field. I think the cardinal would be better if it were brightened up using curves or levels, even if that meant the background would go lighter.</td>', 'I like the way you used shallow depth of field. I think the cardinal would be better if it were brightened up using curves or levels, even if that meant the background would go lighter.', '2004-02-10 12:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(574502, 59021, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good picture of the artist, good sharpness and light (though I don''t know who he is).  I think normally you would have wanted to crop just to the right of him (and maybe even to the left).  I don''t think the head on the right adds to the aesthetics, other than helping you fit the challenge.</td>', 'Good picture of the artist, good sharpness and light (though I don''t know who he is).  I think normally you would have wanted to crop just to the right of him (and maybe even to the left).  I don''t think the head on the right adds to the aesthetics, other than helping you fit the challenge.', '2004-02-10 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(574504, 58640, 12733, '<td valign="top">Clever use of the glasses to define the area of sharp focus.</td>', 'Clever use of the glasses to define the area of sharp focus.', '2004-02-10 12:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(574505, 59072, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the textures on both the horse and the fence, and the soft focus in the background fence. The muted colors emphasize the cold of the season.</td>', 'I like the textures on both the horse and the fence, and the soft focus in the background fence. The muted colors emphasize the cold of the season.', '2004-02-10 12:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(574506, 59237, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot, interesting setting and subject.  I think it might be more interesting to crop off the back of him, including that white stick.  That gets rid of the bright areas, and really gives you nice contrast between his yellow head and the leaves.  Try it (I did by just covering that part on screen)!</td>', 'Good shot, interesting setting and subject.  I think it might be more interesting to crop off the back of him, including that white stick.  That gets rid of the bright areas, and really gives you nice contrast between his yellow head and the leaves.  Try it (I did by just covering that part on screen)!', '2004-02-10 12:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(574507, 59022, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good portrait and composition.  Well lit subject with nice golden light, and good DOF.</td>', 'Good portrait and composition.  Well lit subject with nice golden light, and good DOF.', '2004-02-10 12:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(574510, 58852, 12733, '<td valign="top">The background vegetation is blurred, but the sky dominates so much of the picture, and it really doesn''t show whether it is in or out of focus.</td>', 'The background vegetation is blurred, but the sky dominates so much of the picture, and it really doesn''t show whether it is in or out of focus.', '2004-02-10 12:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(574513, 59211, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very Nice shot.  This looks like it was done using a softening filter or vignette filter rather than by using DOF as the challenge states.</td>', 'Very Nice shot.  This looks like it was done using a softening filter or vignette filter rather than by using DOF as the challenge states.', '2004-02-10 12:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(574514, 59311, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF and good capture.  Perhaps even more blur in the background would have been good.</td>', 'Good use of DOF and good capture.  Perhaps even more blur in the background would have been good.', '2004-02-10 12:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(574515, 58626, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and detail in the flowers, and a nicely out of focus background.</td>', 'Beautiful color and detail in the flowers, and a nicely out of focus background.', '2004-02-10 12:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(574516, 59115, 10686, '<td valign="top">Interesting optical effect in the bowl of the front glass</td>', 'Interesting optical effect in the bowl of the front glass', '2004-02-10 12:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(574517, 59125, 10686, '<td valign="top">neat polka dots...</td>', 'neat polka dots...', '2004-02-10 12:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(574518, 59026, 12733, '<td valign="top">The top half of the pine cone is sharp and clear; IMHO the whole pine cone should be this clear, with only the background out of focus.</td>', 'The top half of the pine cone is sharp and clear; IMHO the whole pine cone should be this clear, with only the background out of focus.', '2004-02-10 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(574519, 59270, 12253, '<td valign="top">Clever and well done, but does seem to lack clarity even in the focal plane.  Perhaps there''s just not enought of a sharp object to stand out as focused.  Could also be the effect of noise, which seems to be evident in the photo.</td>', 'Clever and well done, but does seem to lack clarity even in the focal plane.  Perhaps there''s just not enought of a sharp object to stand out as focused.  Could also be the effect of noise, which seems to be evident in the photo.', '2004-02-10 12:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(574520, 59137, 10686, '<td valign="top">very effective</td>', 'very effective', '2004-02-10 12:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(574521, 59016, 12733, '<td valign="top">The duck looks like he''s s trying to tell us something. The blurred background sets it off well without being too distracting.</td>', 'The duck looks like he''s s trying to tell us something. The blurred background sets it off well without being too distracting.', '2004-02-10 12:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(574522, 58849, 10686, '<td valign="top">Is the icicle really at that angle??</td>', 'Is the icicle really at that angle??', '2004-02-10 12:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(574523, 58924, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but doesn''t seem to have anything in sharp focus!  If the eight ball were crisp, this would be an excellent entry!</td>', 'Nice idea, but doesn''t seem to have anything in sharp focus!  If the eight ball were crisp, this would be an excellent entry!', '2004-02-10 12:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(574525, 58602, 12253, '<td valign="top">This has great light and tones, and what an excellent idea.  The major out of focus piece in the front right which draws attention because of the bright spots on the back detracts from this otherwise excellent work.  Perhaps you needed a bit more DOF.</td>', 'This has great light and tones, and what an excellent idea.  The major out of focus piece in the front right which draws attention because of the bright spots on the back detracts from this otherwise excellent work.  Perhaps you needed a bit more DOF.', '2004-02-10 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(574526, 59238, 10686, '<td valign="top">Overall nice portrait, might be an improvement if this was more of a frontal shot, but I dunno, could go either way.</td>', 'Overall nice portrait, might be an improvement if this was more of a frontal shot, but I dunno, could go either way.', '2004-02-10 12:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(574544, 58891, 4100, '<td valign="top">Great concept and the main subject is very striking, but I wonder if a different crop might have worked better? Or even (this being an Advanced Editing challenge) moving the base of the white target up a bit and then recropping to cut out some of the dead space at the bottom of the frame? I am a big fan of negative space, but this particular area doesn''t seem to add anything.</td>', 'Great concept and the main subject is very striking, but I wonder if a different crop might have worked better? Or even (this being an Advanced Editing challenge) moving the base of the white target up a bit and then recropping to cut out some of the dead space at the bottom of the frame? I am a big fan of negative space, but this particular area doesn''t seem to add anything.', '2004-02-10 12:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(574546, 58894, 4100, '<td valign="top">I think this might have worked better as a whole if the surface had been plain white - the texture distracts a bit from the big chunky blocks.</td>', 'I think this might have worked better as a whole if the surface had been plain white - the texture distracts a bit from the big chunky blocks.', '2004-02-10 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(574548, 59136, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow, I didn''t know these bloomed! I like how the DOF here hints at the entire plant. Your using the rule of thirds works well too. It is also nice to have those other blooms out of focus for contrast.</td>', 'Wow, I didn''t know these bloomed! I like how the DOF here hints at the entire plant. Your using the rule of thirds works well too. It is also nice to have those other blooms out of focus for contrast.', '2004-02-10 12:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(574549, 58987, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice, moody shot. I like the unusual point of view and textures here, too.</td>', 'Nice, moody shot. I like the unusual point of view and textures here, too.', '2004-02-10 12:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(574550, 59021, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow, Dan Zanes! In concert! (Sorry, I don''t know who Mr. Zanes is!). But I do like how depth of field here emphasizes Dan.</td>', 'Wow, Dan Zanes! In concert! (Sorry, I don''t know who Mr. Zanes is!). But I do like how depth of field here emphasizes Dan.', '2004-02-10 12:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(574552, 58414, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors! The focus may be just a little too shallow; it would be nice to get that entire patch of snow in focus. But this is still a very lovely photo. Composition and lines are very nicely used.</td>', 'Very vibrant colors! The focus may be just a little too shallow; it would be nice to get that entire patch of snow in focus. But this is still a very lovely photo. Composition and lines are very nicely used.', '2004-02-10 12:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(574554, 58919, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the dof here hints at other things in the room. I am wondering, however, why the item in focus is the most important. Nice contrasts and interesting point of view here, too.</td>', 'I like how the dof here hints at other things in the room. I am wondering, however, why the item in focus is the most important. Nice contrasts and interesting point of view here, too.', '2004-02-10 12:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(574558, 59276, 4100, '<td valign="top">I really like the image I think you probably had in your head, but I don''t think you''ve quite pulled it off. Whatever that is in the top left-hand corner (a hand holding something?) is really distracting, and I think overall the background would be better a little more out of focus (is that real shallow DOF or Photoshop?). I don''t know how much control you had over the surroundings, but if you could have reduced the clutter on the table down to fewer items (and ideally moved the bubblegum machine) then I think it would be less distracting. Finally, I would personally crop the top off at around the height of where the top of the menu is now because I think that would make for a stronger composition.</td>', 'I really like the image I think you probably had in your head, but I don''t think you''ve quite pulled it off. Whatever that is in the top left-hand corner (a hand holding something?) is really distracting, and I think overall the background would be better a little more out of focus (is that real shallow DOF or Photoshop?). I don''t know how much control you had over the surroundings, but if you could have reduced the clutter on the table down to fewer items (and ideally moved the bubblegum machine) then I think it would be less distracting. Finally, I would personally crop the top off at around the height of where the top of the menu is now because I think that would make for a stronger composition.', '2004-02-10 13:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(574561, 58602, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun use of dof here! I like the little sparkles everywhere. I do kind of wish more attention was on the soldiers; all those sparklies steal my focus a little. Still, great idea and nice work.</td>', 'Fun use of dof here! I like the little sparkles everywhere. I do kind of wish more attention was on the soldiers; all those sparklies steal my focus a little. Still, great idea and nice work.', '2004-02-10 13:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(574563, 58784, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea! This is a new use for this idea that I find interesting and fun.</td>', 'Clever idea! This is a new use for this idea that I find interesting and fun.', '2004-02-10 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(574566, 59038, 4100, '<td valign="top">This kind of shot is becoming a new cliche on dpc (glasses are the new cats, if you will... :-) ), but this is a good example and definitely meets the challenge. Whatever that plain white area is in the top right-hand corner (another sheet of paper?) is a bit distracting.</td>', 'This kind of shot is becoming a new cliche on dpc (glasses are the new cats, if you will... :-) ), but this is a good example and definitely meets the challenge. Whatever that plain white area is in the top right-hand corner (another sheet of paper?) is a bit distracting.', '2004-02-10 13:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(574567, 58944, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really crisp, clear image. I love the colors and soft vase.</td>', 'Really crisp, clear image. I love the colors and soft vase.', '2004-02-10 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(574571, 59086, 6870, '<td valign="top">Akuna matata. What a wonderful phrase! Fun image! The shallow dof works here to bring focus to the meercat, though there isn''t much in the background to indicate that it is blurry. Interesting use of light.</td>', 'Akuna matata. What a wonderful phrase! Fun image! The shallow dof works here to bring focus to the meercat, though there isn''t much in the background to indicate that it is blurry. Interesting use of light.', '2004-02-10 13:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(574572, 59305, 6870, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, but I like the repetitive idea, and the clarity of the the first bottle is very nice.</td>', 'A bit dark, but I like the repetitive idea, and the clarity of the the first bottle is very nice.', '2004-02-10 13:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(574573, 59042, 4100, '<td valign="top">I think this would actually have been more effective as a wide DOF shot - using small aperture to get both the photograph and the man sharp. Obviously then it wouldn''t meet the challenge though :-)</td>', 'I think this would actually have been more effective as a wide DOF shot - using small aperture to get both the photograph and the man sharp. Obviously then it wouldn''t meet the challenge though :-)', '2004-02-10 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(574574, 58898, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super clarity on that droplet! I like the cool colors, too. If the figure in the background were just a teeny tiny bit sharper, it may help put this droplet in context to help your communication better. but very lovely use of color and line and light.</td>', 'Super clarity on that droplet! I like the cool colors, too. If the figure in the background were just a teeny tiny bit sharper, it may help put this droplet in context to help your communication better. but very lovely use of color and line and light.', '2004-02-10 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(574575, 58945, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really intriguing abstract. I kind of wish that more were in focus--which may help accentuate the curves of this leaf, but the colors are very interesting, and the point of view very effective.</td>', 'Really intriguing abstract. I kind of wish that more were in focus--which may help accentuate the curves of this leaf, but the colors are very interesting, and the point of view very effective.', '2004-02-10 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(574577, 58647, 6870, '<td valign="top">Appropropriately dark; nice use of light! Since most of this is in focus, I''m a little  unsure as to  how dof is clearly used here--although the contrast between weapon and head shows an inhuman side of war that I find intriguing and effective.</td>', 'Appropropriately dark; nice use of light! Since most of this is in focus, I''m a little  unsure as to  how dof is clearly used here--although the contrast between weapon and head shows an inhuman side of war that I find intriguing and effective.', '2004-02-10 13:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(574582, 58640, 4100, '<td valign="top">This kind of shot is becoming a new cliche on dpc (glasses are the new cats, if you will... :-) ), but this is a good example and definitely meets the challenge. Good choice of passage, too, good composition and the sepia tone definitely adds something.</td>', 'This kind of shot is becoming a new cliche on dpc (glasses are the new cats, if you will... :-) ), but this is a good example and definitely meets the challenge. Good choice of passage, too, good composition and the sepia tone definitely adds something.', '2004-02-10 13:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(574590, 59227, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures, but I think the shallow DOF could have been put to better use in creating the design.</td>', 'I like the colors and textures, but I think the shallow DOF could have been put to better use in creating the design.', '2004-02-10 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(574592, 59223, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice separation of foreground and background using shallow DOF.</td>', 'Very nice separation of foreground and background using shallow DOF.', '2004-02-10 13:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(574593, 59022, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF to separate foreground and background. This was a good choice of background for this portrait; it doesn''t compete.</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF to separate foreground and background. This was a good choice of background for this portrait; it doesn''t compete.', '2004-02-10 13:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(574596, 59121, 12733, '<td valign="top">The background is definitely out of focus, but it still comes through too busy. Something simpler and in tune with the doll would have been better, IMHO.</td>', 'The background is definitely out of focus, but it still comes through too busy. Something simpler and in tune with the doll would have been better, IMHO.', '2004-02-10 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(574626, 58944, 15403, '<td valign="top">very pretty.  Focus is very sharp and the lighting makes the shot quite interesting</td>', 'very pretty.  Focus is very sharp and the lighting makes the shot quite interesting', '2004-02-10 13:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(574627, 59290, 15403, '<td valign="top">great shot!  You obviously have a wonderful eye</td>', 'great shot!  You obviously have a wonderful eye', '2004-02-10 13:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(574629, 58473, 15403, '<td valign="top">very nice capture.</td>', 'very nice capture.', '2004-02-10 13:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(574632, 59187, 15403, '<td valign="top">great shot...full of emotion and feeling.</td>', 'great shot...full of emotion and feeling.', '2004-02-10 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(574633, 59253, 15403, '<td valign="top">being a Denverite, how could I not love this?????</td>', 'being a Denverite, how could I not love this?????', '2004-02-10 13:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(574635, 59127, 15403, '<td valign="top">very creative subject.</td>', 'very creative subject.', '2004-02-10 14:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(574637, 58555, 15403, '<td valign="top">great idea for this challenge.  Shallow DOF and sharp focus are perfect.</td>', 'great idea for this challenge.  Shallow DOF and sharp focus are perfect.', '2004-02-10 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(574686, 59290, 17061, '<td valign="top">nice balance.  elegant.</td>', 'nice balance.  elegant.', '2004-02-10 15:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(574712, 59085, 10686, '<td valign="top">I hope you gave it to him after the shot...</td>', 'I hope you gave it to him after the shot...', '2004-02-10 15:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(574720, 59225, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice form</td>', 'Nice form', '2004-02-10 15:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(574724, 59102, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the way the red and yellow blend</td>', 'I like the way the red and yellow blend', '2004-02-10 15:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(574729, 59269, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but seems a bit dark overall</td>', 'Good shot, but seems a bit dark overall', '2004-02-10 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(574730, 58650, 16362, '<td valign="top">Amazing hes bald and good looking .Im also very good looking</td>', 'Amazing hes bald and good looking .Im also very good looking', '2004-02-10 15:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(574733, 59021, 16362, '<td valign="top">Love this band!!</td>', 'Love this band!!', '2004-02-10 15:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(574744, 59042, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, I love the idea of this, very good lighting and wonderful DOF, 10</td>', 'Wonderful shot, I love the idea of this, very good lighting and wonderful DOF, 10', '2004-02-10 16:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(574745, 58302, 10848, '<td valign="top">I really like this, some may not like the shadows but I do, I think it adds to this shot, wonderful eyes and you captured them perfectly great job</td>', 'I really like this, some may not like the shadows but I do, I think it adds to this shot, wonderful eyes and you captured them perfectly great job', '2004-02-10 16:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(574751, 59204, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, sort of gives me spring fever. Excelllent DOF, the color variations are wonderful.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, sort of gives me spring fever. Excelllent DOF, the color variations are wonderful.', '2004-02-10 16:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(574752, 59292, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I love the background</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I love the background', '2004-02-10 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(574753, 58861, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the colors, great DOF</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the colors, great DOF', '2004-02-10 16:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(574755, 59160, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea, and very well executed</td>', 'Wonderful idea, and very well executed', '2004-02-10 16:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(574759, 58675, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great macro, the detail is outstanding. Good DOF also</td>', 'Great macro, the detail is outstanding. Good DOF also', '2004-02-10 16:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(574760, 58849, 7438, '<td valign="top">Really smooth bokeh and an interesting composition. It does look a bit cluttered in the top left corner, but that''s nitpicking I suppose</td>', 'Really smooth bokeh and an interesting composition. It does look a bit cluttered in the top left corner, but that''s nitpicking I suppose', '2004-02-10 16:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(574784, 58987, 7438, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been better in B/W I think, or sepia, and with a little more light on the rose to make it stand out better.</td>', 'This would''ve been better in B/W I think, or sepia, and with a little more light on the rose to make it stand out better.', '2004-02-10 16:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(574787, 59067, 7438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. The green in the background looks a bit lonely, and some more of it (or none of it) might have given the picture a better balance. Very nice though.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. The green in the background looks a bit lonely, and some more of it (or none of it) might have given the picture a better balance. Very nice though.', '2004-02-10 16:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(574790, 59299, 7438, '<td valign="top">I want to see less of the plant and more of the sky, or whatever is in the background. And maybe even a wider crop to the right?</td>', 'I want to see less of the plant and more of the sky, or whatever is in the background. And maybe even a wider crop to the right?', '2004-02-10 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
