(574911, 59196, 772, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this photo inspires me.  I think the blue adds to the overall feeling of ''fragility'' here as well.  I like the hightlights on the bubbles and the rim of the glass as well... they offer some nice definition to the objects.  As you can see here, reflective surfaces, no matter how subtle they are, can be tough to work with.  Kudos on a great photo...</td>', 'The simplicity of this photo inspires me.  I think the blue adds to the overall feeling of ''fragility'' here as well.  I like the hightlights on the bubbles and the rim of the glass as well... they offer some nice definition to the objects.  As you can see here, reflective surfaces, no matter how subtle they are, can be tough to work with.  Kudos on a great photo...', '2004-02-10 18:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(574914, 58473, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the shapes here... the contrast is beautiful... excellent work :) -btw, I would love to hear about how you achieve this excellent tonal range in your photo :)</td>', 'I love the shapes here... the contrast is beautiful... excellent work :) -btw, I would love to hear about how you achieve this excellent tonal range in your photo :)', '2004-02-10 19:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
