(574924, 58639, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice details of the ice on the wheat. Natural appearing tones (even though I''ve never seen wheat up close). You can also make out the imperfections in the wheat itself with all the small black spots. Lighting is also excellent. 10.</td>', 'Nice details of the ice on the wheat. Natural appearing tones (even though I''ve never seen wheat up close). You can also make out the imperfections in the wheat itself with all the small black spots. Lighting is also excellent. 10.', '2004-02-10 19:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(574930, 59298, 11653, '<td valign="top">Table cloth is distracting to me.</td>', 'Table cloth is distracting to me.', '2004-02-10 19:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(574960, 58302, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is eerily beautiful. Great lighting and a striking subject. <br/> <br/>Although I don''t have a major problem with this, the eyes have been treated almost a little too much perhaps - leaving the appearance of an early stage of cataracts! She ould be an inhabitant of the planet Dune I suppose, which I haven''t ruled out. ;)<br/> <br/>Fresh take on the challenge and a memorable shot.</td>', 'This is eerily beautiful. Great lighting and a striking subject.  Although I don''t have a major problem with this, the eyes have been treated almost a little too much perhaps - leaving the appearance of an early stage of cataracts! She ould be an inhabitant of the planet Dune I suppose, which I haven''t ruled out. ;) Fresh take on the challenge and a memorable shot.', '2004-02-10 19:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(574963, 59258, 8860, '<td valign="top">A memorable, penetrating shot - which I''m sure will score well. Very dynamic composition.</td>', 'A memorable, penetrating shot - which I''m sure will score well. Very dynamic composition.', '2004-02-10 19:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(574977, 58851, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge. Utter rubbish. [1]<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>Ha ha! Excellent stuff really. Nice bit of detail and good choice of subject. Colours bug me a little, but I wonder if some playing around with colour balance might yield some interesting results (it''s the green and brown that bother me). [8]</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge. Utter rubbish. [1]   Ha ha! Excellent stuff really. Nice bit of detail and good choice of subject. Colours bug me a little, but I wonder if some playing around with colour balance might yield some interesting results (it''s the green and brown that bother me). [8]', '2004-02-10 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(574978, 58784, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s another twist on this concept (but it really is a tired one, although I won''t mark it down just for that!) nicely executed and cleverly done.</td>', 'It''s another twist on this concept (but it really is a tired one, although I won''t mark it down just for that!) nicely executed and cleverly done.', '2004-02-10 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(574982, 59058, 8860, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t help noticing that there is quite a pleasantly shaped breast in this shot!  ;)<br/> <br/>Nice idea, but I''m not convinced about the confusing material, which is a shame because just the body on ots own would have made this very pure. Shadow close to camera is distracting and I think getting in closer would have maximised the DOF effect.</td>', 'I couldn''t help noticing that there is quite a pleasantly shaped breast in this shot!  ;) Nice idea, but I''m not convinced about the confusing material, which is a shame because just the body on ots own would have made this very pure. Shadow close to camera is distracting and I think getting in closer would have maximised the DOF effect.', '2004-02-10 20:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(574988, 59085, 8860, '<td valign="top">Just love this one - totally fresh take on the challenge and a really good use of DOF rather than a gratuitous object (as is the case for mine I''m afraid!) shot close up. This has to be a 10 because I this really represents the concept and is not over-perfect. [10]</td>', 'Just love this one - totally fresh take on the challenge and a really good use of DOF rather than a gratuitous object (as is the case for mine I''m afraid!) shot close up. This has to be a 10 because I this really represents the concept and is not over-perfect. [10]', '2004-02-10 20:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(574991, 58899, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but missing the brief - this is long Depth Of Field (literally!). Got to score it low for that reason I''m afraid, but outside of the challenge this is lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful, but missing the brief - this is long Depth Of Field (literally!). Got to score it low for that reason I''m afraid, but outside of the challenge this is lovely.', '2004-02-10 20:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(574993, 59183, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very surreal and interesting. It''s as if the words are floating off the surface. By the way, what are we looking at anyway?<br/> <br/>I would have cropped this a bit tighter. It can still be done yet maintain the "infinity" feel to the photo. Another reason I would have cropped the top: two odd looking splotches. Good effort, though!</td>', 'Very surreal and interesting. It''s as if the words are floating off the surface. By the way, what are we looking at anyway? I would have cropped this a bit tighter. It can still be done yet maintain the "infinity" feel to the photo. Another reason I would have cropped the top: two odd looking splotches. Good effort, though!', '2004-02-10 20:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(574994, 59217, 8860, '<td valign="top">There is some excellent DOF in this shot, but I reckon most people will score low because of your gimmicky cut out. They''ll presume it was superimposed or something. I''d like to have at least seen his feet on the bark to givve it context.<br/> <br/>I''m going to give it a 7 because, assuming I''m right that this shot is untampered, it''s a great capture.</td>', 'There is some excellent DOF in this shot, but I reckon most people will score low because of your gimmicky cut out. They''ll presume it was superimposed or something. I''d like to have at least seen his feet on the bark to givve it context. I''m going to give it a 7 because, assuming I''m right that this shot is untampered, it''s a great capture.', '2004-02-10 20:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(574999, 59022, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent details of her face, hair and sweater. The afternoon sun lends a nice reddish tone that seems to compliment her complexion well. The background is also well blurred via DOF. Great shot! 9</td>', 'Excellent details of her face, hair and sweater. The afternoon sun lends a nice reddish tone that seems to compliment her complexion well. The background is also well blurred via DOF. Great shot! 9', '2004-02-10 20:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
