(575005, 59027, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice cake and it has excellent details and color. The front/bottom is nicely blurred. The background just doesn''t make sense to me. I understand that this is an indoor shot but maybe something more exciting would have suited this better. It would still be blurred as not to disctract from the cake.</td>', 'Very nice cake and it has excellent details and color. The front/bottom is nicely blurred. The background just doesn''t make sense to me. I understand that this is an indoor shot but maybe something more exciting would have suited this better. It would still be blurred as not to disctract from the cake.', '2004-02-10 20:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(575008, 58784, 11846, '<td valign="top">egads...LOL...I HATE that smiley face....I am glad the ones in the background are frowning!!!Fun pix</td>', 'egads...LOL...I HATE that smiley face....I am glad the ones in the background are frowning!!!Fun pix', '2004-02-10 20:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(575009, 58894, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but too bad you didn''t arrange them in order (RGB). I also think a different angle where the majority of the shot would be the red cylinder slowly fading/bluring to the next piece and then the third and final piece blurred about 70-75%. Like an extreme perspective shot where the tops of the pieces make up the vanishing point and it ends somewhere in the middle of the shot. The blue piece exhibits a minor amount of pixelation.</td>', 'This is a good idea but too bad you didn''t arrange them in order (RGB). I also think a different angle where the majority of the shot would be the red cylinder slowly fading/bluring to the next piece and then the third and final piece blurred about 70-75%. Like an extreme perspective shot where the tops of the pieces make up the vanishing point and it ends somewhere in the middle of the shot. The blue piece exhibits a minor amount of pixelation.', '2004-02-10 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
