(575585, 58992, 9906, '<td valign="top">This seems to be missing something or something just not quite right.  It may be that you need to see what the cat is cleaning (probably a front paw) or maybe simply have her looking into the frame instead of out of the frame...  Still a very nice composition and use of negative space and lighting.  The shallow DOF is not terribly obvious here so it may not score all that well.<br/>TC</td>', 'This seems to be missing something or something just not quite right.  It may be that you need to see what the cat is cleaning (probably a front paw) or maybe simply have her looking into the frame instead of out of the frame...  Still a very nice composition and use of negative space and lighting.  The shallow DOF is not terribly obvious here so it may not score all that well.TC', '2004-02-11 02:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
