(575939, 59249, 13440, '<td valign="top">A little bit overexposed, but colorful nice colors... nice work.</td>', 'A little bit overexposed, but colorful nice colors... nice work.', '2004-02-11 08:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(575954, 58967, 92, '<td valign="top">This works for a few reasons. First, great shallow DOF. ALL of the main subject is crisp and very much so in focus...not to mention interesting. The fern/foliage all comes into the frame from different angles bringing the eye right to the main subject ! Lines at a angle add drama and that WOW factor to a photo. ALL of this  gives this photo impact. The DOF is just enough to be shallow yet add to the photo. I hope you do well and others see this for what it is...GREAT !</td>', 'This works for a few reasons. First, great shallow DOF. ALL of the main subject is crisp and very much so in focus...not to mention interesting. The fern/foliage all comes into the frame from different angles bringing the eye right to the main subject ! Lines at a angle add drama and that WOW factor to a photo. ALL of this  gives this photo impact. The DOF is just enough to be shallow yet add to the photo. I hope you do well and others see this for what it is...GREAT !', '2004-02-11 08:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(575956, 59137, 92, '<td valign="top">Great color and DOF. Composition and lighting are great.</td>', 'Great color and DOF. Composition and lighting are great.', '2004-02-11 08:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(575965, 59276, 92, '<td valign="top">I like this. I see a few things I would fix. The overexposed white area on the car. I would have also cropped this just above the tire so that it didn''t draw the eye there and a little more shallow DOF so that the background area didn''t try to take over the main subject. This is a photo you really should reshoot and make it a print. GREAT subject/scene for a print ! Overall...this is a great photo !</td>', 'I like this. I see a few things I would fix. The overexposed white area on the car. I would have also cropped this just above the tire so that it didn''t draw the eye there and a little more shallow DOF so that the background area didn''t try to take over the main subject. This is a photo you really should reshoot and make it a print. GREAT subject/scene for a print ! Overall...this is a great photo !', '2004-02-11 08:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(575966, 59158, 13440, '<td valign="top">Interesting work! Nice idea.... Great shot.</td>', 'Interesting work! Nice idea.... Great shot.', '2004-02-11 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(575967, 58852, 92, '<td valign="top">oh ok now we''re talking ! I was worried about this challenge once I started voting. This shows a great use of DOF, rich colors, clarity, compositon, use of negative space and most of all...not some snapshot !</td>', 'oh ok now we''re talking ! I was worried about this challenge once I started voting. This shows a great use of DOF, rich colors, clarity, compositon, use of negative space and most of all...not some snapshot !', '2004-02-11 08:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
