(576309, 58899, 7291, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve probablye been told this but this is the opposite of Shallow DOF (unless I''m missing something).  It is, however, a fantastic picture.  Better than anything I''ve ever taken.</td>', 'I know you''ve probablye been told this but this is the opposite of Shallow DOF (unless I''m missing something).  It is, however, a fantastic picture.  Better than anything I''ve ever taken.', '2004-02-11 11:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(576313, 59127, 7291, '<td valign="top">Wow, now THAT''S shallow DOF.  Great choice of subject for the picture.  The curves add allot of interest for your eyes to follow. - 10</td>', 'Wow, now THAT''S shallow DOF.  Great choice of subject for the picture.  The curves add allot of interest for your eyes to follow. - 10', '2004-02-11 11:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(576318, 59168, 7291, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken with black &amp; white film.  Even though I''m sure some detail lost in post processing because of the extreme blacks, I really like how this came out.</td>', 'This looks like it was taken with black & white film.  Even though I''m sure some detail lost in post processing because of the extreme blacks, I really like how this came out.', '2004-02-11 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(576323, 58908, 7291, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of shapes, colors and diffused lighting...but I really don''t see anything in focus here.  I suppose the Lime colored gear is what the focal point is but it still look a little soft.  I still find this to be one of the more interesting photos of this challenge though.</td>', 'Interesting use of shapes, colors and diffused lighting...but I really don''t see anything in focus here.  I suppose the Lime colored gear is what the focal point is but it still look a little soft.  I still find this to be one of the more interesting photos of this challenge though.', '2004-02-11 11:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(576329, 58784, 7291, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Just awesome.  Yes....this technique has been a million times but making sure that there was only 1 large drop that draws your eyes to it is what makes this work. - 10</td>', 'Awesome!  Just awesome.  Yes....this technique has been a million times but making sure that there was only 1 large drop that draws your eyes to it is what makes this work. - 10', '2004-02-11 11:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(576331, 59248, 7291, '<td valign="top">That marble looks like it''s floating. Was it dropped to catch it in mid-air?  Great work!</td>', 'That marble looks like it''s floating. Was it dropped to catch it in mid-air?  Great work!', '2004-02-11 11:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(576392, 59109, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here.</td>', 'I like the colors here.', '2004-02-11 12:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(576437, 59158, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very cool and startling at the same time.  Very well excecuted.</td>', 'Very cool and startling at the same time.  Very well excecuted.', '2004-02-11 12:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(576542, 59127, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like this! Good diagonal composition, the focus tip is on the third, the tone is great, and the border is mimimal but effective. There is more OOF than focus and my eyes do dwell a little on the curls but I dont really see that as a bad thing.</td>', 'I really like this! Good diagonal composition, the focus tip is on the third, the tone is great, and the border is mimimal but effective. There is more OOF than focus and my eyes do dwell a little on the curls but I dont really see that as a bad thing.', '2004-02-11 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(576550, 59196, 6008, '<td valign="top">The background is nice and clear and the blue adds a wonderful mood. The OOF bubble balances the composition well, and I love the sharpness of the in-focus bubble. What looks like a window light reflection adds a complimentary white to the blue as well as give it an almost surreal insight into a mini-world. Very clear and clean shot.</td>', 'The background is nice and clear and the blue adds a wonderful mood. The OOF bubble balances the composition well, and I love the sharpness of the in-focus bubble. What looks like a window light reflection adds a complimentary white to the blue as well as give it an almost surreal insight into a mini-world. Very clear and clean shot.', '2004-02-11 13:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(576561, 59042, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has a great photojournalistic as well as a family memoir mood to it. It''s certainly something I would expect to see in a newspaper/magazine article about the person. The in-focus baby photograph is sharp and clear, and the OOF person is enough to bring the focus to the front but not enough that the person is completely out of the picture either. I like it!</td>', 'This has a great photojournalistic as well as a family memoir mood to it. It''s certainly something I would expect to see in a newspaper/magazine article about the person. The in-focus baby photograph is sharp and clear, and the OOF person is enough to bring the focus to the front but not enough that the person is completely out of the picture either. I like it!', '2004-02-11 13:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(576590, 59308, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture on the ice - I know this isn''t easy to do. The wide variety of layers of unsharpness gives the picture depth.</td>', 'Very nice texture on the ice - I know this isn''t easy to do. The wide variety of layers of unsharpness gives the picture depth.', '2004-02-11 14:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(576593, 58861, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of photographing a flower "in decline," and you have captured the colors and textures well. I would have liked this picture better if the ratio of sharp to unsharp were higher.</td>', 'I like the idea of photographing a flower "in decline," and you have captured the colors and textures well. I would have liked this picture better if the ratio of sharp to unsharp were higher.', '2004-02-11 14:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(576596, 58944, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF to separate the flower from the vase and the whole thing from the background. The vase comes across as misty and mysterious.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF to separate the flower from the vase and the whole thing from the background. The vase comes across as misty and mysterious.', '2004-02-11 14:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(576599, 58616, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s a fierce-looking dragon, and well lighted, but I don''t see enough difference in sharpness to meet the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a fierce-looking dragon, and well lighted, but I don''t see enough difference in sharpness to meet the challenge.', '2004-02-11 14:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(576601, 58949, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice separation of foreground from unsharp background. IMHO the ladybug could have used a bit more exposure. The background would be brighter, but I don''t think that would matter much.</td>', 'Very nice separation of foreground from unsharp background. IMHO the ladybug could have used a bit more exposure. The background would be brighter, but I don''t think that would matter much.', '2004-02-11 14:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(576603, 58840, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of DOF. Possibly a slightly higher camera placement would have brought out the J in jinxed.</td>', 'Very interesting use of DOF. Possibly a slightly higher camera placement would have brought out the J in jinxed.', '2004-02-11 14:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(576604, 59298, 12733, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF sets the pie off from the background nicely.</td>', 'The shallow DOF sets the pie off from the background nicely.', '2004-02-11 14:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(576606, 58672, 12733, '<td valign="top">That snow looks almost like a plush cushion. This photo is effective, and the differential focus is noticeable without being pushy.</td>', 'That snow looks almost like a plush cushion. This photo is effective, and the differential focus is noticeable without being pushy.', '2004-02-11 14:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(576609, 58414, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the lacy texture of the ice against the almost leathery texture of the leaf. The out-of-focus background sets the central subject off well.</td>', 'I like the lacy texture of the ice against the almost leathery texture of the leaf. The out-of-focus background sets the central subject off well.', '2004-02-11 14:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(576610, 59306, 12733, '<td valign="top">A brilliant shot of the car, especially with the hood up and door open. But the overall focus is too sharp for the challenge, which wants some parts of the photo to be out of focus (shallow DOF).</td>', 'A brilliant shot of the car, especially with the hood up and door open. But the overall focus is too sharp for the challenge, which wants some parts of the photo to be out of focus (shallow DOF).', '2004-02-11 14:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(576612, 59200, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the oranges against the out-of-focus abstract background. IMHO cropping out the whole right-hand part of the picture would improve it dramatically.</td>', 'I like the oranges against the out-of-focus abstract background. IMHO cropping out the whole right-hand part of the picture would improve it dramatically.', '2004-02-11 14:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(576613, 59042, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a clever idea, but it would seem that 78 is as worthy of respect (sharp focus) as 2.</td>', 'This is a clever idea, but it would seem that 78 is as worthy of respect (sharp focus) as 2.', '2004-02-11 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(576615, 58781, 12733, '<td valign="top">The difference in focus setts the foreground plant off well. The difference in lighting contributes even more to the separation.</td>', 'The difference in focus setts the foreground plant off well. The difference in lighting contributes even more to the separation.', '2004-02-11 14:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(576617, 58730, 11846, '<td valign="top">wish this had been in color...nice job though</td>', 'wish this had been in color...nice job though', '2004-02-11 14:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(576619, 59158, 12733, '<td valign="top">The effect is disconcerting to say the least. The shallow DOF adds to the unsettling effect of the magnified eye and enhances the unsettling effect.</td>', 'The effect is disconcerting to say the least. The shallow DOF adds to the unsettling effect of the magnified eye and enhances the unsettling effect.', '2004-02-11 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(576620, 59119, 12733, '<td valign="top">The rose seems to lift itself out of the picture when set against the out of focus trees. Very effective. I think I would have cropped it a little tighter.</td>', 'The rose seems to lift itself out of the picture when set against the out of focus trees. Very effective. I think I would have cropped it a little tighter.', '2004-02-11 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(576623, 59288, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of color and focus contrast to make the main subject stand out.</td>', 'Very effective use of color and focus contrast to make the main subject stand out.', '2004-02-11 14:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(576624, 59253, 12733, '<td valign="top">The medal stands out well against the background, and the composition is pleasing.</td>', 'The medal stands out well against the background, and the composition is pleasing.', '2004-02-11 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(576627, 59217, 12733, '<td valign="top">The kookaburra is great, but the slant and the wide frame give the overall picture a gimmicky appearance. IMHO the fact that editing programs let you create bizarre effects is not a mandate to use them to excess.</td>', 'The kookaburra is great, but the slant and the wide frame give the overall picture a gimmicky appearance. IMHO the fact that editing programs let you create bizarre effects is not a mandate to use them to excess.', '2004-02-11 14:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(576628, 59109, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective depth of field, and the colors are great.</td>', 'Nice use of selective depth of field, and the colors are great.', '2004-02-11 14:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(576629, 59018, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract. The out of focus and very bright background sets the shape off well.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract. The out of focus and very bright background sets the shape off well.', '2004-02-11 14:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(576631, 59211, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful soft-focus portrait, and a nice use of selective DOF to set her off from the background.</td>', 'This is a beautiful soft-focus portrait, and a nice use of selective DOF to set her off from the background.', '2004-02-11 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(576633, 58730, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the plant set off by the out-of-focus plants in the background. I think this would be a stronger photo if the main plant were off center and if the out-of-focus petals were all behind it, rather than in front.</td>', 'I like the plant set off by the out-of-focus plants in the background. I think this would be a stronger photo if the main plant were off center and if the out-of-focus petals were all behind it, rather than in front.', '2004-02-11 14:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(576634, 59258, 12733, '<td valign="top">The combination of wide-angle distortion and selective focus makes this an interesting portrait.</td>', 'The combination of wide-angle distortion and selective focus makes this an interesting portrait.', '2004-02-11 14:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(576635, 58895, 12733, '<td valign="top">Infertile - you said it, I didn''t.</td>', 'Infertile - you said it, I didn''t.', '2004-02-11 14:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(576638, 59086, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very handsome merecat, nicely exposed and composed. The background is so dark it''s hard to tell whether it is in or out of focus.</td>', 'A very handsome merecat, nicely exposed and composed. The background is so dark it''s hard to tell whether it is in or out of focus.', '2004-02-11 14:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(576641, 59253, 11846, '<td valign="top">is this supposed to be Milan Hedjuk''s signature? we''ve been trying to decipher it...great year that...when they gave Raymond Bourque the gift....</td>', 'is this supposed to be Milan Hedjuk''s signature? we''ve been trying to decipher it...great year that...when they gave Raymond Bourque the gift....', '2004-02-11 15:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(576666, 59061, 11846, '<td valign="top">great shot..</td>', 'great shot..', '2004-02-11 15:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(576839, 58640, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Lighting is moody and interesting. Nifty shot! 9</td>', 'Very clever. Lighting is moody and interesting. Nifty shot! 9', '2004-02-11 18:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(576841, 58555, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. The DOF plus lighting is well used, as I now desperately want to know all about this! 9</td>', 'Very interesting composition. The DOF plus lighting is well used, as I now desperately want to know all about this! 9', '2004-02-11 18:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(576871, 58922, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast. Dark shirt really accentuates the well-focused hole.  Great shot!</td>', 'Nice color contrast. Dark shirt really accentuates the well-focused hole.  Great shot!', '2004-02-11 18:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(576879, 58736, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good color.  Might''ve been neat to try focusing on second gull to see if near and far birds would''ve been out of focus.</td>', 'Nice shot, good color.  Might''ve been neat to try focusing on second gull to see if near and far birds would''ve been out of focus.', '2004-02-11 18:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(576880, 59026, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the use of DOF here, though you may want to experiment with which cone gets the focus (you probably already have). the tones and colors are very inviting!</td>', 'I like the use of DOF here, though you may want to experiment with which cone gets the focus (you probably already have). the tones and colors are very inviting!', '2004-02-11 18:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(576881, 59302, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice way to compare media!</td>', 'Nice way to compare media!', '2004-02-11 18:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(576883, 59299, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very inviting and engaging tones and colors. I like the point of view and focus. 8</td>', 'Very inviting and engaging tones and colors. I like the point of view and focus. 8', '2004-02-11 18:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(576885, 59090, 12674, '<td valign="top">NIce composition and great lighting and focus on standing coin.  Fits the challenge quite well.</td>', 'NIce composition and great lighting and focus on standing coin.  Fits the challenge quite well.', '2004-02-11 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(576889, 58389, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very engaging point of view here. Colors are warm and inviting. DOF works okay, too.</td>', 'Very engaging point of view here. Colors are warm and inviting. DOF works okay, too.', '2004-02-11 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(576890, 59306, 12674, '<td valign="top">NIce crisp shot with outstanding color, but shallow dof not much in play.</td>', 'NIce crisp shot with outstanding color, but shallow dof not much in play.', '2004-02-11 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(576894, 59253, 6870, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''s a cool puck! DOF invites us to see the puck and then the blurry other objects that by their blurriness invite us to imagine lots of different hockey-related things. Go CO!</td>', 'Now THAT''s a cool puck! DOF invites us to see the puck and then the blurry other objects that by their blurriness invite us to imagine lots of different hockey-related things. Go CO!', '2004-02-11 18:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(576897, 59216, 6870, '<td valign="top">The shrivelled leaves combined with DOF invite thoughts about the entiretey of nature in this state. Nice work!</td>', 'The shrivelled leaves combined with DOF invite thoughts about the entiretey of nature in this state. Nice work!', '2004-02-11 18:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(576899, 59258, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pretty eyes! DOF-created blur helps to indicate a mischievous nature of this person!</td>', 'Pretty eyes! DOF-created blur helps to indicate a mischievous nature of this person!', '2004-02-11 18:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(576900, 58908, 6870, '<td valign="top">I actually like the blur here. It is a good example of soft focus. It is difficult for me to see what is IN focus, though. Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'I actually like the blur here. It is a good example of soft focus. It is difficult for me to see what is IN focus, though. Nice composition and colors.', '2004-02-11 18:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(576903, 58950, 6870, '<td valign="top">How can these guys stay still for so long? Amazing. Your use of blur indicates the subject''s stationary existence (without money anyway), compared to the crowd''s.</td>', 'How can these guys stay still for so long? Amazing. Your use of blur indicates the subject''s stationary existence (without money anyway), compared to the crowd''s.', '2004-02-11 18:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(576904, 58899, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely shot with magnificent composition. I have a hard time seeing DOF at work here, but this is a masterful photo anyway!</td>', 'Very lovely shot with magnificent composition. I have a hard time seeing DOF at work here, but this is a masterful photo anyway!', '2004-02-11 18:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(576905, 59196, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot. Colors and simplicity give it a scientific feel. DOF works well to imply either futher bubbles or the importance of the bubbles. Nice work.</td>', 'Very intriguing shot. Colors and simplicity give it a scientific feel. DOF works well to imply either futher bubbles or the importance of the bubbles. Nice work.', '2004-02-11 18:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(576909, 59157, 6870, '<td valign="top">So you''re getting these already? Lucky you! This is a doubly terrific shot! DOF works so well to isolate the blooms AND to imply further blooms out elsewhere--so you''ve shown that it is a good tool to take the mind beyond the photo. 10</td>', 'So you''re getting these already? Lucky you! This is a doubly terrific shot! DOF works so well to isolate the blooms AND to imply further blooms out elsewhere--so you''ve shown that it is a good tool to take the mind beyond the photo. 10', '2004-02-11 18:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(576910, 58470, 6870, '<td valign="top">"My love is like a red, red rose...." Pretty shot. The DOF helps to take my mind beyond the photo itself and to other things that might be related. The warm background may indicate some romance or love, but more clues would help. 8</td>', '"My love is like a red, red rose...." Pretty shot. The DOF helps to take my mind beyond the photo itself and to other things that might be related. The warm background may indicate some romance or love, but more clues would help. 8', '2004-02-11 18:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(576911, 59081, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice parallel composition. Colors and patterns are interesting and engaging.</td>', 'Nice parallel composition. Colors and patterns are interesting and engaging.', '2004-02-11 18:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(576912, 58852, 6870, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. Your DOF and the use of negative space takes my mind beyond the photo to think about the environment of this plant and not just the plant itself.</td>', 'Great use of negative space. Your DOF and the use of negative space takes my mind beyond the photo to think about the environment of this plant and not just the plant itself.', '2004-02-11 18:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(576914, 59174, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic and interesting image. the DOF is not very narrow here, but I like the leading lines and compositional elements. Nice use of light, too.</td>', 'Very dynamic and interesting image. the DOF is not very narrow here, but I like the leading lines and compositional elements. Nice use of light, too.', '2004-02-11 18:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(576916, 59089, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super light here! I like the painterly look of things  here, especially the background. masterful! 9</td>', 'Super light here! I like the painterly look of things  here, especially the background. masterful! 9', '2004-02-11 18:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(576919, 58554, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good captue of texture and use of DOF.  I like that the towel rides the diagonal.</td>', 'Good captue of texture and use of DOF.  I like that the towel rides the diagonal.', '2004-02-11 18:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(576920, 58615, 6870, '<td valign="top">Light, more than DOF, helps isolate your subject here. But I do like the warm colors and the moody atmosphere. Lovely work.</td>', 'Light, more than DOF, helps isolate your subject here. But I do like the warm colors and the moody atmosphere. Lovely work.', '2004-02-11 18:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(576922, 58660, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  My own interpretation of the composition is that the interwined wire was the "focal point" here, so that''s perhaps what should be in focus.</td>', 'Interesting.  My own interpretation of the composition is that the interwined wire was the "focal point" here, so that''s perhaps what should be in focus.', '2004-02-11 18:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(576924, 59022, 6870, '<td valign="top">She''s a cutie! Nice composition, and good use of light. The blurry background could possibly hint at Kimberly''s good nature and talents? Perhaps with even more hints back there your communication could be even more clear. Nice work. 8</td>', 'She''s a cutie! Nice composition, and good use of light. The blurry background could possibly hint at Kimberly''s good nature and talents? Perhaps with even more hints back there your communication could be even more clear. Nice work. 8', '2004-02-11 18:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(576926, 58470, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I would have loved to see the type of OOF colors on the lower left dominate the entire background (may not be the scene, but that provides the greatest contrast and impact.)</td>', 'Nice capture.  I would have loved to see the type of OOF colors on the lower left dominate the entire background (may not be the scene, but that provides the greatest contrast and impact.)', '2004-02-11 18:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(576928, 59214, 6870, '<td valign="top">Chess with a twist! The tones and colors here really get me excited. your DOF works well to isolate the pawn as the check-mating element. 9</td>', 'Chess with a twist! The tones and colors here really get me excited. your DOF works well to isolate the pawn as the check-mating element. 9', '2004-02-11 18:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(576931, 59307, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea! I like DOF  here as it helps to bring a mystique to the image.</td>', 'Fun idea! I like DOF  here as it helps to bring a mystique to the image.', '2004-02-11 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(576932, 59042, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good concept for this photo.  I would have liked to see a little stronger (direct view) of the photo and perhaps less distance between the two.</td>', 'Very good concept for this photo.  I would have liked to see a little stronger (direct view) of the photo and perhaps less distance between the two.', '2004-02-11 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(576933, 59288, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nifty image! That one nut is so nicely isolated from its peers in both focus and tone. Very nice work! 9</td>', 'Very nifty image! That one nut is so nicely isolated from its peers in both focus and tone. Very nice work! 9', '2004-02-11 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(576935, 59127, 6870, '<td valign="top">Just the tip, eh? I like the idea a lot! 8</td>', 'Just the tip, eh? I like the idea a lot! 8', '2004-02-11 18:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(576937, 59072, 6870, '<td valign="top">DOF here helps to isolate this animal so much. Very nice composition.</td>', 'DOF here helps to isolate this animal so much. Very nice composition.', '2004-02-11 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(576941, 58891, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very extreme point of view and DOF here! Had you tried focusing on where the arrow meets the target? Probably. A tighter crop may help to bring even more focus on your subject.</td>', 'Very extreme point of view and DOF here! Had you tried focusing on where the arrow meets the target? Probably. A tighter crop may help to bring even more focus on your subject.', '2004-02-11 18:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(576943, 59038, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal lines here, and the DOF makes that phrase stick out nicely. Clear and interesting image.</td>', 'I like the diagonal lines here, and the DOF makes that phrase stick out nicely. Clear and interesting image.', '2004-02-11 18:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(576944, 59137, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nifty image! The DOF here makes me think beyond the image and subject itself, which is a really great thing. 9</td>', 'Very nifty image! The DOF here makes me think beyond the image and subject itself, which is a really great thing. 9', '2004-02-11 19:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(576948, 58894, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal line here made with the objects, which makes the whole scene more dynamic and dramatic. DOF helps focus on the red cylinder, though the blue cube has the stronger position in the frame. Lighting is cool and nearly emotionless. Interesting study!</td>', 'I like the diagonal line here made with the objects, which makes the whole scene more dynamic and dramatic. DOF helps focus on the red cylinder, though the blue cube has the stronger position in the frame. Lighting is cool and nearly emotionless. Interesting study!', '2004-02-11 19:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(576949, 59043, 6870, '<td valign="top">DOF here works to bring focus to the lamp, and I like how we can still see some of the things behind, which helps to put the lamp in context. The whole image is a bit busy, though.</td>', 'DOF here works to bring focus to the lamp, and I like how we can still see some of the things behind, which helps to put the lamp in context. The whole image is a bit busy, though.', '2004-02-11 19:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(576950, 58675, 6870, '<td valign="top">These look like Easter eggs! Very interesting macro.</td>', 'These look like Easter eggs! Very interesting macro.', '2004-02-11 19:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(576951, 58491, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nifty abstract! DOF adds to the mood and atmosphere. 9</td>', 'Nifty abstract! DOF adds to the mood and atmosphere. 9', '2004-02-11 19:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(576953, 59065, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very inviting tones and colors! I like the almost random pattern here. DOF helps to imply many more corks. 9</td>', 'Very inviting tones and colors! I like the almost random pattern here. DOF helps to imply many more corks. 9', '2004-02-11 19:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(576954, 58654, 6870, '<td valign="top">This shroom looks like it is doing a dance! Nice use of contrast and DOF to set it apart from its surroundings.</td>', 'This shroom looks like it is doing a dance! Nice use of contrast and DOF to set it apart from its surroundings.', '2004-02-11 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(576956, 58756, 6870, '<td valign="top">These are cute catkins. The lighting on them is just a bit harsh, but the DOF really works to set them apart. Nice composition, too.</td>', 'These are cute catkins. The lighting on them is just a bit harsh, but the DOF really works to set them apart. Nice composition, too.', '2004-02-11 19:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(576958, 59183, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very engaging, interesting image. I like the use of DOF here, which seems to imply that the text goes on forever.</td>', 'Very engaging, interesting image. I like the use of DOF here, which seems to imply that the text goes on forever.', '2004-02-11 19:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(576990, 59132, 2158, '<td valign="top">I think perhaps you could have had a little more depth of field, so that it was easier to see that the flower was a rose.</td>', 'I think perhaps you could have had a little more depth of field, so that it was easier to see that the flower was a rose.', '2004-02-11 19:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(577071, 59174, 13440, '<td valign="top">Interesting light with a nice DOF. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting light with a nice DOF. Well done.', '2004-02-11 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(577074, 59132, 13440, '<td valign="top">Nice and Beautiful color... Nice DOF. well done</td>', 'Nice and Beautiful color... Nice DOF. well done', '2004-02-11 20:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(577075, 58784, 13440, '<td valign="top">Nice color with great DOF... Nice work</td>', 'Nice color with great DOF... Nice work', '2004-02-11 20:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(577195, 59072, 8054, '<td valign="top">Details, colors and focusing are nice and exact. Composition is good for the most part. The only part I''d do differently is avoiding fence bits from going through the head of your subject (in reference to the background).  :)  Good effort otherwise.</td>', 'Details, colors and focusing are nice and exact. Composition is good for the most part. The only part I''d do differently is avoiding fence bits from going through the head of your subject (in reference to the background).  :)  Good effort otherwise.', '2004-02-11 21:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(577200, 59229, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks like there is a tinge of blue to the Lilac bud that could have been corrected. Nice job cropping and good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Looks like there is a tinge of blue to the Lilac bud that could have been corrected. Nice job cropping and good luck in the challenge!', '2004-02-11 21:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(577204, 58967, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice background. Lends a nice tone to the fern even though it''s not the same color yet. Nice details on the new fern shoot. I might have cropped the bottom a bit closer as the edge as it is now is a bit uneven. 7.</td>', 'Nice background. Lends a nice tone to the fern even though it''s not the same color yet. Nice details on the new fern shoot. I might have cropped the bottom a bit closer as the edge as it is now is a bit uneven. 7.', '2004-02-11 21:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
