(577439, 59200, 13403, '<td valign="top">reminds me of the decorative oranges people grow..   i was down in phoenix with a buddy of mine at his grandma''s summer home...   every plant there is the devil..  cacti are soooo lame..   some of their needles jut out of the ground feet away from the base of the actual plant!  HOW LAME IS THAT???   well, nobody told me..   anyway, after i stopped bleeding, we had a ''ornamental orange'' brawl..  we chucked those things at each other for so long.    they smelled really good but apparantly they''re really acidic..   wow..  no reason to tell you that story, but i''m not deleting it now..   nice picture.</td>', 'reminds me of the decorative oranges people grow..   i was down in phoenix with a buddy of mine at his grandma''s summer home...   every plant there is the devil..  cacti are soooo lame..   some of their needles jut out of the ground feet away from the base of the actual plant!  HOW LAME IS THAT???   well, nobody told me..   anyway, after i stopped bleeding, we had a ''ornamental orange'' brawl..  we chucked those things at each other for so long.    they smelled really good but apparantly they''re really acidic..   wow..  no reason to tell you that story, but i''m not deleting it now..   nice picture.', '2004-02-12 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
