(577556, 58660, 7687, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and subject matter...great choice for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition and subject matter...great choice for this challenge.', '2004-02-12 03:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(577558, 58941, 7687, '<td valign="top">I predict this will ribbon and probably win, although that isn''t a very hard prediction to make.  Of course this image is striking because it''s a waterdrop image, but the thing that I like the best is the symmetry as well as the bottle at the bottom of the image.  <br/> <br/>I was going to suggest having the bottle in the background flipped around so it appears upright in the waterdrop; but after thinking about it, I like this the way it is.  I like how the water at the top is white against the orange and how the upright label in the background is recognizable because it''s upright.  Of course that''s my opinion, others may feel differently.  Nice work and contratulations!</td>', 'I predict this will ribbon and probably win, although that isn''t a very hard prediction to make.  Of course this image is striking because it''s a waterdrop image, but the thing that I like the best is the symmetry as well as the bottle at the bottom of the image.   I was going to suggest having the bottle in the background flipped around so it appears upright in the waterdrop; but after thinking about it, I like this the way it is.  I like how the water at the top is white against the orange and how the upright label in the background is recognizable because it''s upright.  Of course that''s my opinion, others may feel differently.  Nice work and contratulations!', '2004-02-12 03:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(577559, 58899, 7687, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.  I really like the subject matter, composition and the choice of black and white, but I''m not entirely sure how this meets the shallow depth of field criteria.  <br/> <br/>If you''d like to point out how you feel this image adheres to the challenge rules, please respond to this comment and I''ll rethink my vote...because I really like this shot.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.  I really like the subject matter, composition and the choice of black and white, but I''m not entirely sure how this meets the shallow depth of field criteria.   If you''d like to point out how you feel this image adheres to the challenge rules, please respond to this comment and I''ll rethink my vote...because I really like this shot.', '2004-02-12 03:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(577560, 58944, 10848, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, the background color and the subtle blue vase work well together, the brightness of your subject in contrast with your background is great, makes your subject really stand out.</td>', 'beautiful shot, the background color and the subtle blue vase work well together, the brightness of your subject in contrast with your background is great, makes your subject really stand out.', '2004-02-12 03:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
