(578391, 58925, 16912, '<td valign="top">I like it, imho I''d have seen many shots like this for the challenge but this is the first and an excellent shot.</td>', 'I like it, imho I''d have seen many shots like this for the challenge but this is the first and an excellent shot.', '2004-02-12 19:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
