(578771, 59300, 9906, '<td valign="top">two things I noticed right away and not sure how to fix one of them...  First of all this looks flat (no depth) and I attribute that to TOO shallow DOF.  The other thing is that the blade appears to not be straight and I''m sure that is a perspective issue and I have no clue what to do for that in this instance.<br/>TC</td>', 'two things I noticed right away and not sure how to fix one of them...  First of all this looks flat (no depth) and I attribute that to TOO shallow DOF.  The other thing is that the blade appears to not be straight and I''m sure that is a perspective issue and I have no clue what to do for that in this instance.TC', '2004-02-13 01:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
