(578776, 59223, 9906, '<td valign="top">I almost didn''t notice the face in the background!  Nice composition and exposure.  You didn''t blow out the white of the flower and that is good.  However, to me, the face in the background looks a little purpleish (It may just be me and my color issues).  Is this a white balance issue?<br/>TC</td>', 'I almost didn''t notice the face in the background!  Nice composition and exposure.  You didn''t blow out the white of the flower and that is good.  However, to me, the face in the background looks a little purpleish (It may just be me and my color issues).  Is this a white balance issue?TC', '2004-02-13 01:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
