(578847, 58672, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull place and composition. Snowman as designer. And I think you made the best to make it fit the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderfull place and composition. Snowman as designer. And I think you made the best to make it fit the challenge. Good luck.', '2004-02-13 02:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(578852, 59205, 5158, '<td valign="top">That''s great! Is it your clock? When I was young at these tubes came out, I was totally amazed by them and liked how the numbers were jumping. <br/>Great composition and well exposed. And it''s of course right on the challenge topic.</td>', 'That''s great! Is it your clock? When I was young at these tubes came out, I was totally amazed by them and liked how the numbers were jumping. Great composition and well exposed. And it''s of course right on the challenge topic.', '2004-02-13 02:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(578857, 59259, 5158, '<td valign="top">A classic well composed. Only the light could be set bette, especially at the top: a bit to harsh. Still, a 8 from me.</td>', 'A classic well composed. Only the light could be set bette, especially at the top: a bit to harsh. Still, a 8 from me.', '2004-02-13 02:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(578864, 59085, 5158, '<td valign="top">LOL! I know that kind of look of a dog. However, I would never use a fork: it would be eaten too. Also our Kaja would not sit still for long. <br/>Very well done regarding the composition and light. a 9 from me.</td>', 'LOL! I know that kind of look of a dog. However, I would never use a fork: it would be eaten too. Also our Kaja would not sit still for long. Very well done regarding the composition and light. a 9 from me.', '2004-02-13 02:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(578870, 59300, 5158, '<td valign="top">I do like the composition and the colours very much. Maybe the DOF is a bit too narrow: parts of the fruit are out of focus too. A little wider DOF might have been better. Good luck.</td>', 'I do like the composition and the colours very much. Maybe the DOF is a bit too narrow: parts of the fruit are out of focus too. A little wider DOF might have been better. Good luck.', '2004-02-13 02:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(578872, 59065, 5158, '<td valign="top">Took me while to get it, but I like it: nice texture and well on the challenge topic. The crop is maybe a bit tight. Good luck.</td>', 'Took me while to get it, but I like it: nice texture and well on the challenge topic. The crop is maybe a bit tight. Good luck.', '2004-02-13 02:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(578874, 59102, 5158, '<td valign="top">I do like the colours, especially how the orange of the pencil blends with the red background. I do think that a bit wider DOF, showing more of the pencil tip in focus would have worked better though.</td>', 'I do like the colours, especially how the orange of the pencil blends with the red background. I do think that a bit wider DOF, showing more of the pencil tip in focus would have worked better though.', '2004-02-13 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
