(579116, 58784, 5792, '<td valign="top">Of all the DPC images ever submitted using the water drop technique this one is technically the best, that includes the DPC famous "Liberty and Justice" winner.<br/> <br/>Use of the ROT and overall general effect make this an outstanding image. This is the class of the field in this challenge.</td>', 'Of all the DPC images ever submitted using the water drop technique this one is technically the best, that includes the DPC famous "Liberty and Justice" winner. Use of the ROT and overall general effect make this an outstanding image. This is the class of the field in this challenge.', '2004-02-13 09:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(579119, 58736, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF, especially the birds in the background. Wonderfully captured pose by your main subject. Great image. Slightly oversharpened with hallowing in the rightmost tail feathers.</td>', 'Great use of DOF, especially the birds in the background. Wonderfully captured pose by your main subject. Great image. Slightly oversharpened with hallowing in the rightmost tail feathers.', '2004-02-13 09:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(579120, 59158, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very creative concept for shallow DOF challenge. Exceptional technical quality. This will be a top finisher.</td>', 'Very creative concept for shallow DOF challenge. Exceptional technical quality. This will be a top finisher.', '2004-02-13 09:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(579125, 58941, 5792, '<td valign="top">Unique concept and exceptionally well done.  Like the water drop technique this uses refraction within a water drop to create a sharp reversed image but this has to be much harder to capture this way. Kudos to you for this wonderful image.<br/> <br/>This should be a top finisher in this challenge</td>', 'Unique concept and exceptionally well done.  Like the water drop technique this uses refraction within a water drop to create a sharp reversed image but this has to be much harder to capture this way. Kudos to you for this wonderful image. This should be a top finisher in this challenge', '2004-02-13 10:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(579127, 59253, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup, good color and nice use of ROT.</td>', 'Nicely setup, good color and nice use of ROT.', '2004-02-13 10:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(579132, 59269, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice photo! One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo! One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-02-13 10:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(579133, 59085, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well concieved and technically good.<br/>What makes this image good for this challenge is the relationship between the main subject and the dog waiting to eat it up. Like this one, the best images  should relate the shallow focused main subject in a unique way with the out-of-focus background (or foreground as te case may be).</td>', 'Well concieved and technically good.What makes this image good for this challenge is the relationship between the main subject and the dog waiting to eat it up. Like this one, the best images  should relate the shallow focused main subject in a unique way with the out-of-focus background (or foreground as te case may be).', '2004-02-13 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(579135, 59085, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! This is one of my top picks in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot! This is one of my top picks in this challenge.', '2004-02-13 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(579136, 59127, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image. It is a great concept for this challenge for only a tiny fraction of the image to be in focus and the tip of the corkscrew is perfect for this purpose.</td>', 'Exceptional image. It is a great concept for this challenge for only a tiny fraction of the image to be in focus and the tip of the corkscrew is perfect for this purpose.', '2004-02-13 10:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(579139, 59042, 16230, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and a fine execution too. It might have been even better if the man''s face were just a tiny bit more in focus. One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Great idea, and a fine execution too. It might have been even better if the man''s face were just a tiny bit more in focus. One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-02-13 10:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(579141, 59183, 16230, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice image!</td>', 'Wow, nice image!', '2004-02-13 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(579142, 58660, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great concept for this challenge. Composition good. It would be better if the plug ends were in crisp sharp focus.</td>', 'Great concept for this challenge. Composition good. It would be better if the plug ends were in crisp sharp focus.', '2004-02-13 10:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(579144, 58941, 16230, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2004-02-13 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
