(579670, 59085, 8054, '<td valign="top">LOL, this is excellent! Gotta love the way the dog has his/her head tilted to get a better view. Classic Pavlov! Oh, and the dog is well blurred and focus on the meat is good, too.  :) 10</td>', 'LOL, this is excellent! Gotta love the way the dog has his/her head tilted to get a better view. Classic Pavlov! Oh, and the dog is well blurred and focus on the meat is good, too.  :) 10', '2004-02-14 01:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(579671, 59157, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better if there was more negative space above the flowers and maybe even some to the left or right. As it is now, composition is too centered, in my opinion. The flowers have nice tonal balance and details, however.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better if there was more negative space above the flowers and maybe even some to the left or right. As it is now, composition is too centered, in my opinion. The flowers have nice tonal balance and details, however.', '2004-02-14 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(579674, 59205, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Not sure exactly what they are but they look neat! Something from the ''50s era?</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Not sure exactly what they are but they look neat! Something from the ''50s era?', '2004-02-14 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(579676, 59238, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Excellent facial details and skin color. The background is just not interesting enough for me, however.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Excellent facial details and skin color. The background is just not interesting enough for me, however.', '2004-02-14 01:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(579677, 58908, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF shot. The only thing I might have done differently; crop the bottom a bit tighter.The lower left corner is a bit distracting to me. If you cropped above that and used partial orange and yellow gears, it might shift even more focus onto the green one.</td>', 'Nice DOF shot. The only thing I might have done differently; crop the bottom a bit tighter.The lower left corner is a bit distracting to me. If you cropped above that and used partial orange and yellow gears, it might shift even more focus onto the green one.', '2004-02-14 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(579678, 59026, 8054, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the pinecone on the table surface vs floating above it. You did a great job of preserving focus and details, though.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the pinecone on the table surface vs floating above it. You did a great job of preserving focus and details, though.', '2004-02-14 01:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(579680, 59058, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice chice going b/w with this shot! Somehow nudes always look better this way. I think it might look better, and more focused, if cropped a lot more off the bottom. I know that sounds radical but i think the large shadow in the lower left corner is grabbing too much attention. If it was cropped out completely, you could also make the rest of the image larger. And, not sure if anything could be done about the odd-shaped shadow between the knees. It''s a great image, however. Good luck! 8</td>', 'Nice chice going b/w with this shot! Somehow nudes always look better this way. I think it might look better, and more focused, if cropped a lot more off the bottom. I know that sounds radical but i think the large shadow in the lower left corner is grabbing too much attention. If it was cropped out completely, you could also make the rest of the image larger. And, not sure if anything could be done about the odd-shaped shadow between the knees. It''s a great image, however. Good luck! 8', '2004-02-14 01:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(579683, 59204, 8054, '<td valign="top">Flowers show lots of details but they appear to be a bit oversharpened. They seem to be a bit pixelated as well as the background. Or maybe there is too much compression. Not sure. If the details were sharper and less pixelated, I''d rate this higher.</td>', 'Flowers show lots of details but they appear to be a bit oversharpened. They seem to be a bit pixelated as well as the background. Or maybe there is too much compression. Not sure. If the details were sharper and less pixelated, I''d rate this higher.', '2004-02-14 01:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(579684, 59237, 8054, '<td valign="top">Flash is too direct and bright.</td>', 'Flash is too direct and bright.', '2004-02-14 01:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(579686, 58554, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like the earthy tones. This would have been great for the textures challenge, too! Good job with the application of DOF. What is this anyway? packing material?</td>', 'I like the earthy tones. This would have been great for the textures challenge, too! Good job with the application of DOF. What is this anyway? packing material?', '2004-02-14 01:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(579687, 59115, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks like a selective radial blur was applied to the rest of the glasses. Nice effect, nonetheless. But it looks like your background "horizon" is not level even though it is curved.</td>', 'Looks like a selective radial blur was applied to the rest of the glasses. Nice effect, nonetheless. But it looks like your background "horizon" is not level even though it is curved.', '2004-02-14 01:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(579688, 59011, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and composition. I also like the reflections from the bell onto the sheet music. Great job. I just find the reflection in the bell a bit distracting (greenish blob). 8.</td>', 'Nice shot and composition. I also like the reflections from the bell onto the sheet music. Great job. I just find the reflection in the bell a bit distracting (greenish blob). 8.', '2004-02-14 01:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(579691, 58922, 8054, '<td valign="top">Umm, I''m pretty sure it was unintentional but the boy has his middle finger raised up. Otherwise, good effort.</td>', 'Umm, I''m pretty sure it was unintentional but the boy has his middle finger raised up. Otherwise, good effort.', '2004-02-14 02:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(579693, 58302, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excllent image! Great color in the eyes and skin. Looks like the hair was part of the blurred DOF so I won''t deduct from there although it would be so much better if they were in sharp focus. I think it could use a smidgen of cropping off the left side to eliminate the small blue corner in the upper right. Plus I think this would look nicer with a slimmer profile. It would concentrate the viewers'' focus on the girls face especially the eyes. 9.</td>', 'Excllent image! Great color in the eyes and skin. Looks like the hair was part of the blurred DOF so I won''t deduct from there although it would be so much better if they were in sharp focus. I think it could use a smidgen of cropping off the left side to eliminate the small blue corner in the upper right. Plus I think this would look nicer with a slimmer profile. It would concentrate the viewers'' focus on the girls face especially the eyes. 9.', '2004-02-14 02:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(579698, 58794, 10848, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, this is great. Wonderful clarity and focus.</td>', 'Stunning shot, this is great. Wonderful clarity and focus.', '2004-02-14 02:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
