(580044, 58944, 14986, '<td valign="top">How lovely.   The crisp white against the softness of the blues/purples just works for me.  Really gorgeous.</td>', 'How lovely.   The crisp white against the softness of the blues/purples just works for me.  Really gorgeous.', '2004-02-14 18:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(580045, 58922, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea for DOF.    The only thing I might change is maybe which finger is raised?  I know that''s not the intent, but for some it might be distracting.</td>', 'I think this is a great idea for DOF.    The only thing I might change is maybe which finger is raised?  I know that''s not the intent, but for some it might be distracting.', '2004-02-14 18:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(580056, 58302, 14986, '<td valign="top">Don''t have membership yet, so can''t vote, however this is beautiful.   Doesn''t quite show the dof as much as some of the others, but I am just drawn by how well this is done.   The pose, the lighting,  and the expression of the eyes are all just perfect.</td>', 'Don''t have membership yet, so can''t vote, however this is beautiful.   Doesn''t quite show the dof as much as some of the others, but I am just drawn by how well this is done.   The pose, the lighting,  and the expression of the eyes are all just perfect.', '2004-02-14 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(580080, 58672, 2553, '<td valign="top">I adore this shot. Composition is superb, as is the black and white.  Subject is great; this is gallery material my friend! 10</td>', 'I adore this shot. Composition is superb, as is the black and white.  Subject is great; this is gallery material my friend! 10', '2004-02-14 18:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(580081, 58899, 2553, '<td valign="top">This style looks familiar, so can hardly wait to see whose shot this is.  I love the shot.  I''m not entirely crazy about the border - it seems to draw my eyes away from the photo, and that''s a sorry shame, ''cause the photo is a thing of beauty.  10</td>', 'This style looks familiar, so can hardly wait to see whose shot this is.  I love the shot.  I''m not entirely crazy about the border - it seems to draw my eyes away from the photo, and that''s a sorry shame, ''cause the photo is a thing of beauty.  10', '2004-02-14 18:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(580083, 58672, 7778, '<td valign="top">If I were pressed to criticize this wonderful photo, I''d wish for a less distinct background (greater DoF) and a greater expanse for the three invisible graces (or winter fairies) to view. I do feel the exposure is quite good considering the difficulty under such conditions. The blowing snow, undulating shadows as well as the brightly lit padding on top of the chairs, each, are poignantly there.<br/> <br/>Overall, the capture is unique, alive with wind and air (despite the dead of winter) and artistically satisfying. It is one of my two favourite choices in this challenge. God help those who fail to be stirred by it. ;-)</td>', 'If I were pressed to criticize this wonderful photo, I''d wish for a less distinct background (greater DoF) and a greater expanse for the three invisible graces (or winter fairies) to view. I do feel the exposure is quite good considering the difficulty under such conditions. The blowing snow, undulating shadows as well as the brightly lit padding on top of the chairs, each, are poignantly there. Overall, the capture is unique, alive with wind and air (despite the dead of winter) and artistically satisfying. It is one of my two favourite choices in this challenge. God help those who fail to be stirred by it. ;-)', '2004-02-14 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(580084, 58898, 2553, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot make it rather breathtaking!  The droplet looks like mercury, or something similarly shiny.  I don''t care for the dead center composition, and would prefer to see the white on the right side cropped out, but nevertheless - 9</td>', 'The colors in this shot make it rather breathtaking!  The droplet looks like mercury, or something similarly shiny.  I don''t care for the dead center composition, and would prefer to see the white on the right side cropped out, but nevertheless - 9', '2004-02-14 18:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(580085, 58967, 2553, '<td valign="top">THIS is what DOF is all about!! Exquisite shot, I expect to see you on the home page next week.  10</td>', 'THIS is what DOF is all about!! Exquisite shot, I expect to see you on the home page next week.  10', '2004-02-14 18:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(580086, 58992, 2553, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably catch hell from the cat-haters, but hey, who cares!  Love the shot, in fact one of my favorite kitty shots!  Although there is use of shallow DOF, for me, this would fall more into the category of negative space.  I really like the composition and the resulting neg spc, it gives it a lot of impact.  9</td>', 'You''ll probably catch hell from the cat-haters, but hey, who cares!  Love the shot, in fact one of my favorite kitty shots!  Although there is use of shallow DOF, for me, this would fall more into the category of negative space.  I really like the composition and the resulting neg spc, it gives it a lot of impact.  9', '2004-02-14 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(580087, 58736, 2553, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot!  There is really nothing here that I would "pick on" - I like the shot a lot, the composition works beautifully, but it lacks that "something" unexpected, unusual, or impactful  that would take it to a "10".  9</td>', 'Terrific shot!  There is really nothing here that I would "pick on" - I like the shot a lot, the composition works beautifully, but it lacks that "something" unexpected, unusual, or impactful  that would take it to a "10".  9', '2004-02-14 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(580089, 59061, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely shot of this creature.  I like the shadows in the background, but the blown out highlight really draws my eye away from the subject, thereby minimizing the impact of the beauty of the butterfly (or moth?).</td>', 'Quite lovely shot of this creature.  I like the shadows in the background, but the blown out highlight really draws my eye away from the subject, thereby minimizing the impact of the beauty of the butterfly (or moth?).', '2004-02-14 18:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(580091, 59157, 2553, '<td valign="top">The purple color is wonderful!  I think this shot could have really had immense impact for me with a more dynamic angle on the flowers.  Don''t get me wrong - this is very nice, and I do like it, but it''s just missing something!  It needs a 3rd flower, or to be shot from a slightly higher angle, or SOMETHING!  It just needs that little something "extra" to take it to the level of a 10 for me.  Sorry I can''t seem to explain myself any better tonight!  9</td>', 'The purple color is wonderful!  I think this shot could have really had immense impact for me with a more dynamic angle on the flowers.  Don''t get me wrong - this is very nice, and I do like it, but it''s just missing something!  It needs a 3rd flower, or to be shot from a slightly higher angle, or SOMETHING!  It just needs that little something "extra" to take it to the level of a 10 for me.  Sorry I can''t seem to explain myself any better tonight!  9', '2004-02-14 18:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(580092, 59273, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow - great dof, and very impactful color.  I can''t put my finger on it, but the composition is "off" for me.  Just too static I think. 8</td>', 'Wow - great dof, and very impactful color.  I can''t put my finger on it, but the composition is "off" for me.  Just too static I think. 8', '2004-02-14 19:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(580093, 59127, 2553, '<td valign="top">Oddly simple and interesting.  Love the choice of coloration, and the dof is perfect for this shot and subject.  The composition is unexpectedly  appealing to me - Definitely a wall hanger here.  Not so impactful as to knock me out, but definitely worth a 9.</td>', 'Oddly simple and interesting.  Love the choice of coloration, and the dof is perfect for this shot and subject.  The composition is unexpectedly  appealing to me - Definitely a wall hanger here.  Not so impactful as to knock me out, but definitely worth a 9.', '2004-02-14 19:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(580096, 58524, 12160, '<td valign="top">I can see the shallow dof even though the photo is too small. How much of the focused subject is in focus is hard to tell.</td>', 'I can see the shallow dof even though the photo is too small. How much of the focused subject is in focus is hard to tell.', '2004-02-14 19:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(580097, 59240, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow dof, good focus on the petals at the front. Reminds me a lot of summertime since this is a very popular flower. Can''t wait.</td>', 'Nice shallow dof, good focus on the petals at the front. Reminds me a lot of summertime since this is a very popular flower. Can''t wait.', '2004-02-14 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(580098, 59249, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good closeup of the colored pencils. The composition is very interesting thanks to the great vivid colors captured. Colors seem to blend together to give the shot great harmony. From a "7" now with a second look upping to a "9"</td>', 'Good closeup of the colored pencils. The composition is very interesting thanks to the great vivid colors captured. Colors seem to blend together to give the shot great harmony. From a "7" now with a second look upping to a "9"', '2004-02-14 19:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(580099, 58924, 12160, '<td valign="top">great idea, good composition. but the 8 ball appears out of focus.</td>', 'great idea, good composition. but the 8 ball appears out of focus.', '2004-02-14 19:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(580100, 58794, 12160, '<td valign="top">good shallow dof, nice focus on the subject.</td>', 'good shallow dof, nice focus on the subject.', '2004-02-14 19:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(580103, 59196, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very original composition. The beautiful highlights in the bubble really makes it (no pun intended) pop out of the shot.The blurring of the background bubbles helps also to bring it out. It''s very crisp and sharp definition makes this a very impressive image. The color choosen for the background is very nice. Simple composition with a vertical crop works perfectly.<br/> <br/>Only thing I don''t like is the choice of the frame. Way too dark. Maybe a lighter color or no frame would work better. Even with this nothing less then a "10"</td>', 'Very original composition. The beautiful highlights in the bubble really makes it (no pun intended) pop out of the shot.The blurring of the background bubbles helps also to bring it out. It''s very crisp and sharp definition makes this a very impressive image. The color choosen for the background is very nice. Simple composition with a vertical crop works perfectly. Only thing I don''t like is the choice of the frame. Way too dark. Maybe a lighter color or no frame would work better. Even with this nothing less then a "10"', '2004-02-14 19:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(580113, 59097, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice soft focus and shallow dof. subject is clearly isolated from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'nice soft focus and shallow dof. subject is clearly isolated from the rest of the photo.', '2004-02-14 19:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(580114, 59196, 12160, '<td valign="top">love the simplicity, very effective shallow dof.</td>', 'love the simplicity, very effective shallow dof.', '2004-02-14 19:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(580201, 58473, 12475, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image; my favorite of this challenge!  Congratulations for spotting the potential here. I''d hang this in my home, for sure.</td>', 'Gorgeous image; my favorite of this challenge!  Congratulations for spotting the potential here. I''d hang this in my home, for sure.', '2004-02-14 21:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(580202, 58861, 12475, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I''m a sucker for fading flowers. Wonderful color, composition, everything. Beautiful.</td>', 'Oooh, I''m a sucker for fading flowers. Wonderful color, composition, everything. Beautiful.', '2004-02-14 21:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(580203, 58650, 12475, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait.</td>', 'Terrific portrait.', '2004-02-14 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(580204, 59225, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I think the focus choice works very well.</td>', 'This is lovely. I think the focus choice works very well.', '2004-02-14 21:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(580205, 59273, 12475, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and detail.</td>', 'Wonderful color and detail.', '2004-02-14 21:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(580206, 59160, 12475, '<td valign="top">How to take a dead leaf and make it beautifil. I love the colors, composition, everything.</td>', 'How to take a dead leaf and make it beautifil. I love the colors, composition, everything.', '2004-02-14 21:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(580207, 59300, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts in color here and interesting composition.</td>', 'Great contrasts in color here and interesting composition.', '2004-02-14 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(580208, 59132, 12475, '<td valign="top">My new favorite flower photo. Very interesting choice of what to focus on. Works beautifully.</td>', 'My new favorite flower photo. Very interesting choice of what to focus on. Works beautifully.', '2004-02-14 21:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(580209, 59067, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and such a smooth appearance.  It''s a very pretty shot with a simple subject.</td>', 'Very nice colors and such a smooth appearance.  It''s a very pretty shot with a simple subject.', '2004-02-14 21:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(580211, 58898, 12475, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I love the colors, and the simplicity.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I love the colors, and the simplicity.', '2004-02-14 21:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(580213, 59116, 12475, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the shallow DOF here as I do in other photos.</td>', 'I don''t see the shallow DOF here as I do in other photos.', '2004-02-14 21:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(580214, 59199, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very unique composition.  I love the colors and the sharpness of it.  The only thing that distracts my eye is the little hot spot near the middle left.  But still a great photo.  Very nice use of shadows and light.</td>', 'This is a very unique composition.  I love the colors and the sharpness of it.  The only thing that distracts my eye is the little hot spot near the middle left.  But still a great photo.  Very nice use of shadows and light.', '2004-02-14 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(580215, 58524, 12475, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get lots of comments that this is too small. It is hard to see; but I like the composition and subject a lot.</td>', 'You''ll probably get lots of comments that this is too small. It is hard to see; but I like the composition and subject a lot.', '2004-02-14 21:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(580216, 58271, 12475, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what the black blobs are. The rest of it works! But the main focused-in-on objects should be clear, I think.</td>', 'I am not sure what the black blobs are. The rest of it works! But the main focused-in-on objects should be clear, I think.', '2004-02-14 21:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(580217, 58829, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, you really made the right choice in putting the blue marble up front, it''s very eye catching.  I also like the little shadow it casts.  Very nice!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, you really made the right choice in putting the blue marble up front, it''s very eye catching.  I also like the little shadow it casts.  Very nice!', '2004-02-14 21:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(580221, 59311, 14620, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Love the subject matter and also really  like all the splashes of blue around the photo even in the lion itself.  It''s very interesting.</td>', 'Love it!  Love the subject matter and also really  like all the splashes of blue around the photo even in the lion itself.  It''s very interesting.', '2004-02-14 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(580222, 58960, 12475, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this rock was the best subject for this contest.</td>', 'I don''t think this rock was the best subject for this contest.', '2004-02-14 21:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(580226, 59102, 14620, '<td valign="top">Really like the background color you chose.  It really adds to what could be a not so interesting subject.  But it really makes the picture pop.  Very nice DOF as well.</td>', 'Really like the background color you chose.  It really adds to what could be a not so interesting subject.  But it really makes the picture pop.  Very nice DOF as well.', '2004-02-14 21:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(580228, 58924, 12475, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The 8 ball is not sharp enough, though.</td>', 'Good idea. The 8 ball is not sharp enough, though.', '2004-02-14 21:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(580229, 59127, 14620, '<td valign="top">Really like the tones of this shot and especially the detail in the tip.  Very nice!</td>', 'Really like the tones of this shot and especially the detail in the tip.  Very nice!', '2004-02-14 21:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(580230, 58847, 12475, '<td valign="top">The dog is a nice subject; but the shallow DOF isn''t really showing well in this photo. And where are the otters? :)</td>', 'The dog is a nice subject; but the shallow DOF isn''t really showing well in this photo. And where are the otters? :)', '2004-02-14 21:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(580231, 59089, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Beautiful colors, beautiful subject and great DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Beautiful colors, beautiful subject and great DOF.', '2004-02-14 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(580233, 59258, 14620, '<td valign="top">My what big eyes you have!! :-)  Just kidding... I love the coloring around the eyes, it''s very pretty and adds much interest to the shot.</td>', 'My what big eyes you have!! :-)  Just kidding... I love the coloring around the eyes, it''s very pretty and adds much interest to the shot.', '2004-02-14 21:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(580236, 59183, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea.  Really like the colors and the waves in the fabric (?)  Nice use of shadows.  Wonder what this is though...</td>', 'Very interesting idea.  Really like the colors and the waves in the fabric (?)  Nice use of shadows.  Wonder what this is though...', '2004-02-14 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(580237, 58966, 14620, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed, hard to shoot metal and not get hot spots and the crop seems a little cramped to me.  I like the subject matter though.</td>', 'A little overexposed, hard to shoot metal and not get hot spots and the crop seems a little cramped to me.  I like the subject matter though.', '2004-02-14 21:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(580239, 58927, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow, now that''s a real close close-up, is that a seed pod of some sort?  Really like the colors, seems just a tiny bit oversharpened maybe or maybe that''s just the texture of whatever that is inside.</td>', 'Wow, now that''s a real close close-up, is that a seed pod of some sort?  Really like the colors, seems just a tiny bit oversharpened maybe or maybe that''s just the texture of whatever that is inside.', '2004-02-14 21:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(580241, 59262, 14620, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the pins in the back look really wierd to me for some reason, though you could be going for a more abstract feel in which case it works.</td>', 'Nice composition but the pins in the back look really wierd to me for some reason, though you could be going for a more abstract feel in which case it works.', '2004-02-14 21:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(580244, 59282, 14620, '<td valign="top">You might try just a little softer lighting next time, seems a little harsh on the front orange especially.  Good DOF though.</td>', 'You might try just a little softer lighting next time, seems a little harsh on the front orange especially.  Good DOF though.', '2004-02-14 21:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(580246, 58863, 14620, '<td valign="top">Like your composition with the orange peel in the back, adds a little interest.  Good DOF.</td>', 'Like your composition with the orange peel in the back, adds a little interest.  Good DOF.', '2004-02-14 21:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(580250, 58898, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors, I''m trying to figure out what''s in the the drop... looks like Barney. :)</td>', 'Very pretty colors, I''m trying to figure out what''s in the the drop... looks like Barney. :)', '2004-02-14 21:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(580251, 59051, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is very very pretty, very nice colors and excellent DOF.</td>', 'This is very very pretty, very nice colors and excellent DOF.', '2004-02-14 21:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(580252, 59168, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and the tones are fabulous!  Very well thought out.</td>', 'Very nicely composed and the tones are fabulous!  Very well thought out.', '2004-02-14 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(580253, 58987, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light and shadows, nicely composed shot.</td>', 'Very nice use of light and shadows, nicely composed shot.', '2004-02-14 21:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(580255, 59006, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF.  Just my opinion but you should try this again against a white background, it might make the blocks pop much more, as they are so colorful but seem to be competing with all the colors of this background.  But I can see you were going for a colorful shot here in which case my suggestion may be mute. :-)</td>', 'Very good DOF.  Just my opinion but you should try this again against a white background, it might make the blocks pop much more, as they are so colorful but seem to be competing with all the colors of this background.  But I can see you were going for a colorful shot here in which case my suggestion may be mute. :-)', '2004-02-14 21:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(580256, 58524, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, I wish it were bigger so we could see more details of the bird though.</td>', 'This is very nice, I wish it were bigger so we could see more details of the bird though.', '2004-02-14 21:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(580318, 59109, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice colors, composition, framing. well done on the shallow dof</td>', 'nice colors, composition, framing. well done on the shallow dof', '2004-02-15 01:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(580320, 59311, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very busy background. good use of shallow dof isolated the subject from the rest of the photo. well done. 8</td>', 'Very busy background. good use of shallow dof isolated the subject from the rest of the photo. well done. 8', '2004-02-15 01:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(580326, 59121, 8953, '<td valign="top">cute:) 8</td>', 'cute:) 8', '2004-02-15 02:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
