(580362, 59270, 9906, '<td valign="top">With these subjects and the amount of grain in this shot I can tell what is not if focus, but I can''t really tell what is in focus...<br/>TC</td>', 'With these subjects and the amount of grain in this shot I can tell what is not if focus, but I can''t really tell what is in focus...TC', '2004-02-15 04:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
