(580378, 59160, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice title and a very good pic.10</td>', 'Nice title and a very good pic.10', '2004-02-15 06:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(580379, 59086, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot.</td>', 'I like it a lot.', '2004-02-15 06:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(580380, 59300, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like the color here.</td>', 'I like the color here.', '2004-02-15 06:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(580381, 59225, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely light.</td>', 'Lovely light.', '2004-02-15 06:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(580382, 58944, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very good and I like it.</td>', 'Very good and I like it.', '2004-02-15 06:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(580390, 59102, 15530, '<td valign="top">Excellent focal point with a very shallow depth of field</td>', 'Excellent focal point with a very shallow depth of field', '2004-02-15 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(580413, 58849, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and effective use of shallow DOF. I find the image rotation a little too inconsistent with my expectations of gravity, but it does add some interest.</td>', 'Nice composition and effective use of shallow DOF. I find the image rotation a little too inconsistent with my expectations of gravity, but it does add some interest.', '2004-02-15 10:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(580461, 59221, 3540, '<td valign="top">Not sure why the back one is in focus here.  Seems more effective to me to put the front one in focus unless there was something outstanding about the one in back that makes it more noticeable and interesting.</td>', 'Not sure why the back one is in focus here.  Seems more effective to me to put the front one in focus unless there was something outstanding about the one in back that makes it more noticeable and interesting.', '2004-02-15 11:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(580462, 58941, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very very well done.  I''m more of a Jack fan myself, but I guess this works too.  Nice shot</td>', 'Very very well done.  I''m more of a Jack fan myself, but I guess this works too.  Nice shot', '2004-02-15 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(580463, 59217, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting trick.  But I think even using this technique, he''s still a little close to the edges of the frame.  I don''t think I like the angle of this photo either.  Doesn''t make it right or wrong really, just personal preference.</td>', 'Interesting trick.  But I think even using this technique, he''s still a little close to the edges of the frame.  I don''t think I like the angle of this photo either.  Doesn''t make it right or wrong really, just personal preference.', '2004-02-15 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(580464, 58756, 3540, '<td valign="top">The shadows on the left hurt you.  If the leftmost plants were all in shadows that would be better, but the way they are, I think its too distracting.  Odd way of framing this too.</td>', 'The shadows on the left hurt you.  If the leftmost plants were all in shadows that would be better, but the way they are, I think its too distracting.  Odd way of framing this too.', '2004-02-15 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(580465, 59242, 3540, '<td valign="top">Get a Gibson.  Oh yea, pretty good shot too :)</td>', 'Get a Gibson.  Oh yea, pretty good shot too :)', '2004-02-15 11:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(580466, 58945, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is almost a really cool abstract.  Needs to fill the frame a little more.  Also needs the focus part to be sharper than what it is.  I think this photo would do well with one degree of sharpening is PS.</td>', 'This is almost a really cool abstract.  Needs to fill the frame a little more.  Also needs the focus part to be sharper than what it is.  I think this photo would do well with one degree of sharpening is PS.', '2004-02-15 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(580467, 58899, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.  I cannot see how it fits this challenge.  The framing and the toning is really well done.  It''s not very dynamic and it is a little dreary, but its not a bad shot.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.  I cannot see how it fits this challenge.  The framing and the toning is really well done.  It''s not very dynamic and it is a little dreary, but its not a bad shot.', '2004-02-15 11:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(580472, 59013, 3540, '<td valign="top">This has a haze over it.  Its not as sharp as it needs to be.  I think it would be much better with the cat''s eye open as well.  I''m not wild about the idea either.  I''m not sure how it works for this challenge.</td>', 'This has a haze over it.  Its not as sharp as it needs to be.  I think it would be much better with the cat''s eye open as well.  I''m not wild about the idea either.  I''m not sure how it works for this challenge.', '2004-02-15 11:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
