(580553, 59110, 1031, '<td valign="top">Egg looks a little oversharpened on the top-right, but otherwise I like the exposure and idea -- I think a lot of shallow DOF compositions are horizontal, not vertical.</td>', 'Egg looks a little oversharpened on the top-right, but otherwise I like the exposure and idea -- I think a lot of shallow DOF compositions are horizontal, not vertical.', '2004-02-15 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
