(580567, 59217, 1031, '<td valign="top">I find the transition from bird to background to be a little too sharp, and makes it look almost artificial. The difference in the focus (feathers vs. background) is enough to make it pop out for me. I like the technique of the subject breaking into the frame, but I''m not completely sure I actually like that and the tilting here. But given that''s the look you wanted, it''s well-done!</td>', 'I find the transition from bird to background to be a little too sharp, and makes it look almost artificial. The difference in the focus (feathers vs. background) is enough to make it pop out for me. I like the technique of the subject breaking into the frame, but I''m not completely sure I actually like that and the tilting here. But given that''s the look you wanted, it''s well-done!', '2004-02-15 14:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(580576, 58924, 1031, '<td valign="top">To complete the analogy, and emphasize the sharpness/focus on the 8-ball, I''d put just a bit of the cue-ball in the (left?) foreground, out of focus.</td>', 'To complete the analogy, and emphasize the sharpness/focus on the 8-ball, I''d put just a bit of the cue-ball in the (left?) foreground, out of focus.', '2004-02-15 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
