(580836, 59013, 11769, '<td valign="top">Almost. Cute cat.</td>', 'Almost. Cute cat.', '2004-02-15 20:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(580837, 59055, 11769, '<td valign="top">Thats how Ive felt all my life. Just kidding, very nice job.</td>', 'Thats how Ive felt all my life. Just kidding, very nice job.', '2004-02-15 20:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(580840, 58624, 11769, '<td valign="top">I work in the dental field so this has special meaning. To bad it is so blurry. Or is that my eyes failing, and Ive got this tooth ach.</td>', 'I work in the dental field so this has special meaning. To bad it is so blurry. Or is that my eyes failing, and Ive got this tooth ach.', '2004-02-15 20:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(580845, 59055, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good job getting the focus in the center. The red leads my eye right to the spot.</td>', 'Good job getting the focus in the center. The red leads my eye right to the spot.', '2004-02-15 21:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(580847, 59157, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful. very effective dof. great colors.</td>', 'beautiful. very effective dof. great colors.', '2004-02-15 21:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(580849, 59067, 12160, '<td valign="top">very nice colors, comp. simple and shallow dof works.</td>', 'very nice colors, comp. simple and shallow dof works.', '2004-02-15 21:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(580852, 58967, 12160, '<td valign="top">subject is nicely isolated from the busy background. great colors, focus is crisp on the subject. well done.</td>', 'subject is nicely isolated from the busy background. great colors, focus is crisp on the subject. well done.', '2004-02-15 21:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(580856, 58473, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture and use of DOF</td>', 'Beautiful capture and use of DOF', '2004-02-15 21:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(580858, 58949, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good capture; I like the opposing diagonals here!  The area of the branch in the foreground is a bit overwhelming.  You might consider a crop on the left, perhaps making the picture square which might work nicely with the diagonals.  Even if the bug ends up being centered, the diagonals will make it worth breaking the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Good capture; I like the opposing diagonals here!  The area of the branch in the foreground is a bit overwhelming.  You might consider a crop on the left, perhaps making the picture square which might work nicely with the diagonals.  Even if the bug ends up being centered, the diagonals will make it worth breaking the rule of thirds.', '2004-02-15 21:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(580863, 59204, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well composed and cropped, and meets the challenge well.  I think a bit more DOF would have been good, if you could have captured all the red flowers in focus.</td>', 'Well composed and cropped, and meets the challenge well.  I think a bit more DOF would have been good, if you could have captured all the red flowers in focus.', '2004-02-15 21:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(580870, 58660, 11800, '<td valign="top">Funny. She looks so distressed. I like the limited pallette. It has a bit of a red tint to it but that doesn''t matter that much. I like it.</td>', 'Funny. She looks so distressed. I like the limited pallette. It has a bit of a red tint to it but that doesn''t matter that much. I like it.', '2004-02-15 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(580886, 59200, 11800, '<td valign="top">The picture is captured nicely. The lighting is superb. I don''t usually spend time commenting on the frame but I must say this one is not good. The blurryness goofs up my eyes when I try to look at the edges.  A frame should confine not punish. Sorry.</td>', 'The picture is captured nicely. The lighting is superb. I don''t usually spend time commenting on the frame but I must say this one is not good. The blurryness goofs up my eyes when I try to look at the edges.  A frame should confine not punish. Sorry.', '2004-02-15 21:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(580898, 59115, 11800, '<td valign="top">It looks like you added a motion blur instead of a regular gaussian blur. The bases look like they are moving.</td>', 'It looks like you added a motion blur instead of a regular gaussian blur. The bases look like they are moving.', '2004-02-15 21:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(580902, 59248, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice way to go about it. Very creative. The highlights are a little harsh,imo. Other than that, good job.</td>', 'Nice way to go about it. Very creative. The highlights are a little harsh,imo. Other than that, good job.', '2004-02-15 21:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(580909, 58473, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I like the repetition. Lovely detail and tones. Did you have a cross screen star filter on or was it taken thru a window?</td>', 'Beautiful. I like the repetition. Lovely detail and tones. Did you have a cross screen star filter on or was it taken thru a window?', '2004-02-15 22:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(580913, 59299, 11800, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and clarity.</td>', 'Lovely colors and clarity.', '2004-02-15 22:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(580917, 59261, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very nice,perfect for kitchen decoration, 10 !</td>', 'Very nice,perfect for kitchen decoration, 10 !', '2004-02-15 22:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(580918, 59240, 11800, '<td valign="top">The pastels are beautiful. Focus excellent. The dark area on the bottom right could go, imo.</td>', 'The pastels are beautiful. Focus excellent. The dark area on the bottom right could go, imo.', '2004-02-15 22:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(580919, 59109, 6405, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo !</td>', 'Excellent photo !', '2004-02-15 22:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(580938, 59217, 10818, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bird, and a really nice shot...not real fond of the boarder..but I do like the photo alot, nice dof also..  7</td>', 'Cool looking bird, and a really nice shot...not real fond of the boarder..but I do like the photo alot, nice dof also..  7', '2004-02-15 22:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(580940, 58953, 10818, '<td valign="top">Om my...that is yummy...jeez I need sugar.<br/>Great shot.</td>', 'Om my...that is yummy...jeez I need sugar.Great shot.', '2004-02-15 22:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(580942, 58941, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, very very well done.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, very very well done.', '2004-02-15 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(580943, 58302, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this fits the challenge.  I don''t know, and quite frankly don''t care.  In terms of pictures, this is one of the top 3 in the challenge.  Awesome portrait and I think this young lady should be very flattered with this portrait.  I originally scored this 7, just bumped it to 8 and am kicking myself for not giving it a 9, which I will do momentarily.  Great picture.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this fits the challenge.  I don''t know, and quite frankly don''t care.  In terms of pictures, this is one of the top 3 in the challenge.  Awesome portrait and I think this young lady should be very flattered with this portrait.  I originally scored this 7, just bumped it to 8 and am kicking myself for not giving it a 9, which I will do momentarily.  Great picture.', '2004-02-15 22:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(580952, 59043, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the colors. Is that a picture behind the lamp? They go nice together.</td>', 'I like the colors. Is that a picture behind the lamp? They go nice together.', '2004-02-15 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(580953, 58626, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, beautiful photo.</td>', 'Very nice colors, beautiful photo.', '2004-02-15 23:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(580954, 58839, 12160, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. 10</td>', 'Excellent shot. 10', '2004-02-15 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(580961, 58794, 11800, '<td valign="top">OH. Cute.</td>', 'OH. Cute.', '2004-02-15 23:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(580963, 58736, 6600, '<td valign="top">Good lack of DOF beyond, nice sharp gull in front.  Good color, nice job. - Not sure I like this type of crop.</td>', 'Good lack of DOF beyond, nice sharp gull in front.  Good color, nice job. - Not sure I like this type of crop.', '2004-02-15 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(580965, 58855, 6600, '<td valign="top">Certainly fits the DOF challenge, but does not make a very interesting photo.</td>', 'Certainly fits the DOF challenge, but does not make a very interesting photo.', '2004-02-15 23:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(580967, 58992, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like cats. Wish I could see whatever s/he was licking. Good focus. It''s a little close to the right edge, imo. I''ve never been able to get a shot like this.</td>', 'I like cats. Wish I could see whatever s/he was licking. Good focus. It''s a little close to the right edge, imo. I''ve never been able to get a shot like this.', '2004-02-15 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(580968, 59072, 6600, '<td valign="top">Pretty horse, nice lack of DOF beyond, good color.  Nice job.</td>', 'Pretty horse, nice lack of DOF beyond, good color.  Nice job.', '2004-02-15 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(580971, 58959, 6600, '<td valign="top">This shot has overall stiff and woody feeling about it.... (just kidding)....  Nice lack of DOF beyond, like the compositon.  Good job.</td>', 'This shot has overall stiff and woody feeling about it.... (just kidding)....  Nice lack of DOF beyond, like the compositon.  Good job.', '2004-02-15 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(580972, 59155, 14012, '<td valign="top">Funny. Very well done</td>', 'Funny. Very well done', '2004-02-15 23:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(580973, 58781, 11800, '<td valign="top">Excellent message in this one. Thank you.</td>', 'Excellent message in this one. Thank you.', '2004-02-15 23:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(580975, 59127, 14012, '<td valign="top">Definately a shallow DOF! I think it may be a bit too shallow though.</td>', 'Definately a shallow DOF! I think it may be a bit too shallow though.', '2004-02-15 23:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(580976, 58784, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m happy to give you this score. Even though this has been done 1 million times, this is the best one so far.</td>', 'I''m happy to give you this score. Even though this has been done 1 million times, this is the best one so far.', '2004-02-15 23:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(580978, 58524, 14012, '<td valign="top">It''s so small, it is hard to tell if the cardinal is in focus.</td>', 'It''s so small, it is hard to tell if the cardinal is in focus.', '2004-02-15 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(580979, 58389, 14012, '<td valign="top">Dust that fret board!  :-)  Good job...I thought about doing something similar.</td>', 'Dust that fret board!  :-)  Good job...I thought about doing something similar.', '2004-02-15 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(580982, 59211, 14012, '<td valign="top">This looks more like soft focus, rather than a shallow DOF, IMHO. A shallow DOF is supposed to bring your subject out from it''s surrondings. With this soft focus, the subject is almost blended into the surrondings.</td>', 'This looks more like soft focus, rather than a shallow DOF, IMHO. A shallow DOF is supposed to bring your subject out from it''s surrondings. With this soft focus, the subject is almost blended into the surrondings.', '2004-02-15 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(580985, 59217, 14012, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for the boarder and think it detracts.</td>', 'I personally don''t care for the boarder and think it detracts.', '2004-02-15 23:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(580986, 59085, 7969, '<td valign="top">This should be an add for a raw dog food add, lol.   well done</td>', 'This should be an add for a raw dog food add, lol.   well done', '2004-02-15 23:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(580990, 58473, 8953, '<td valign="top">Just another super job David! congrats</td>', 'Just another super job David! congrats', '2004-02-16 00:01:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(580991, 58473, 16046, '<td valign="top">I knew this would be #1, great job, kudo''s!</td>', 'I knew this would be #1, great job, kudo''s!', '2004-02-16 00:01:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(580993, 58555, 16301, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the great comments, I really appriciate it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-18 02:17:34.</i></td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the great comments, I really appriciate it.', '2004-02-16 00:03:20.000000', '2004-02-18 02:17:34.000000', 0),
(580994, 58784, 8891, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  HATE the happy face in general but your use of it here made for a great image for this challenge!   RoB</td>', 'Congrats!  HATE the happy face in general but your use of it here made for a great image for this challenge!   RoB', '2004-02-16 00:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(580995, 58473, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow! I didn''t think this would happen! I paid a price for the nice tones here. It was quite darkish, and shot in the shade to boot, which made some nice shades happen--but the ice crystals lost their clarity and sharpness. These leaves were already quite dark, and with the channel mixer, I converted to b/w. Some of you also noted the digital noise in the form of squares in the lower left--this was due to gaussian blur, but it only took a little! I probably should have left it alone. There were a lot of high quality  images during this challenge; I feel really lucky to have won another ribbon. I thought it would be much higher scoring. I just keep learning from you all. Thanks for the votes!</td>', 'Wow! I didn''t think this would happen! I paid a price for the nice tones here. It was quite darkish, and shot in the shade to boot, which made some nice shades happen--but the ice crystals lost their clarity and sharpness. These leaves were already quite dark, and with the channel mixer, I converted to b/w. Some of you also noted the digital noise in the form of squares in the lower left--this was due to gaussian blur, but it only took a little! I probably should have left it alone. There were a lot of high quality  images during this challenge; I feel really lucky to have won another ribbon. I thought it would be much higher scoring. I just keep learning from you all. Thanks for the votes!', '2004-02-16 00:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(580997, 58941, 8891, '<td valign="top">Sublime! Guess humor won out. THis is Great!!!  RoB</td>', 'Sublime! Guess humor won out. THis is Great!!!  RoB', '2004-02-16 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(581002, 58784, 6870, '<td valign="top">I figured this would do well. Nice work, Aleks!</td>', 'I figured this would do well. Nice work, Aleks!', '2004-02-16 00:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(581004, 58941, 15768, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe my happy faces won against this one... this one''s the BEST!</td>', 'I can''t believe my happy faces won against this one... this one''s the BEST!', '2004-02-16 00:07:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(581005, 59085, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun stuff, Tom! Keep up the good work! I''m glad this photo did well.</td>', 'Fun stuff, Tom! Keep up the good work! I''m glad this photo did well.', '2004-02-16 00:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(581011, 58941, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very classy image, Joerg!</td>', 'Very classy image, Joerg!', '2004-02-16 00:09:54.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(581016, 59217, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent and original take on the Challenge.  Sorry you didn''t score higher with the voters.  However, you have the satisfaction of knowing you pulled off a difficult shot very well.  And birds are darned hard to get in good detail.</td>', 'This is an excellent and original take on the Challenge.  Sorry you didn''t score higher with the voters.  However, you have the satisfaction of knowing you pulled off a difficult shot very well.  And birds are darned hard to get in good detail.', '2004-02-16 00:10:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(581018, 59204, 15360, '<td valign="top">Nice pic Van.  I like the colors and lighting... gave this one an 8</td>', 'Nice pic Van.  I like the colors and lighting... gave this one an 8', '2004-02-16 00:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(581024, 58473, 6900, '<td valign="top">Congrats....again!</td>', 'Congrats....again!', '2004-02-16 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(581029, 58554, 16563, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great comments. I guess this isn''t a bad first attempt at this challenge thing eh? Even got a 10, which is just kick ass. <br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great comments. I guess this isn''t a bad first attempt at this challenge thing eh? Even got a 10, which is just kick ass. ', '2004-02-16 00:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(581030, 58794, 15360, '<td valign="top">I like this picture it was one of my favorites of this challenge.  Gave this one a 9</td>', 'I like this picture it was one of my favorites of this challenge.  Gave this one a 9', '2004-02-16 00:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(581035, 58892, 15360, '<td valign="top">I really liked this picture, was one of my favorites.</td>', 'I really liked this picture, was one of my favorites.', '2004-02-16 00:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(581062, 58950, 326, '<td valign="top">Will this print be for sale? My 18 year old daughter wants to buy one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-16 00:31:22.</i></td>', 'Will this print be for sale? My 18 year old daughter wants to buy one.', '2004-02-16 00:27:06.000000', '2004-02-16 00:31:22.000000', 0),
(581144, 59058, 9073, '<td valign="top">This shot is, well, as you said <i>tit</i>ilating. Well done. You''ve clearly met the challenge, and I don''t think that a pencil would have worked quite as well.<br/> <br/>As always, Tarique, good stuff.<br/> <br/>(You might think about re-entering this subject in the textures challenge...)</td>', 'This shot is, well, as you said titilating. Well done. You''ve clearly met the challenge, and I don''t think that a pencil would have worked quite as well. As always, Tarique, good stuff. (You might think about re-entering this subject in the textures challenge...)', '2004-02-16 00:57:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(581189, 59055, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I agree with Helgi''s remark that the end not showing would have been more effective. <br/> <br/>Lovely lines. I was drawn to this from the thumbnail. I like this a lot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-16 01:14:17.</i></td>', 'Nice shot. I agree with Helgi''s remark that the end not showing would have been more effective.  Lovely lines. I was drawn to this from the thumbnail. I like this a lot.', '2004-02-16 01:12:32.000000', '2004-02-16 01:14:17.000000', 0),
(581249, 59109, 259, '<td valign="top">underrated</td>', 'underrated', '2004-02-16 02:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(581257, 59085, 5158, '<td valign="top">Congrats to your first and well deserved ribbon!<br/>It''s one of my favorits as you know. Pretty tight race, wasn''t it?<br/> <br/>Jörg</td>', 'Congrats to your first and well deserved ribbon!It''s one of my favorits as you know. Pretty tight race, wasn''t it? Jörg', '2004-02-16 02:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(581261, 58784, 5158, '<td valign="top">Congrats to your first ribbon! You used the drop-technique extremely creative by not only showing some blurred backround sharp in them, but rather make an object (the simley) in them.<br/>Way to go.<br/> <br/>Jörg</td>', 'Congrats to your first ribbon! You used the drop-technique extremely creative by not only showing some blurred backround sharp in them, but rather make an object (the simley) in them.Way to go. Jörg', '2004-02-16 02:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(581263, 58473, 5158, '<td valign="top">Also congrats form my side! Well deserved!<br/>The great leaf would have work for texture too.<br/> <br/>Jörg</td>', 'Also congrats form my side! Well deserved!The great leaf would have work for texture too. Jörg', '2004-02-16 02:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(581292, 58941, 5158, '<td valign="top">Thanx to all voters and especially all of the plenty commenters to make the image 4th place!<br/>Making the image was a hard job, but more for the shutter due to the many images that needed to be taken to get nice drops.<br/>I once did this with a wine bottle in 2002 with my A40<br/><a href="//home.tu-clausthal.de/~pcja/gallery/water/IMG_5931" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//home.tu-clausthal.de/~pcja/albums/water/IMG_5931.thumb.jpg'', strrpos(''//home.tu-clausthal.de/~pcja/albums/water/IMG_5931.thumb.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//home.tu-clausthal.de/~pcja/albums/water/IMG_5931.thumb.jpg"/></a> <br/>Acctually the A40 worked better for this job.<br/> <br/>I allways wanted to redo this and this challenge came just right.<br/>Here''s the original. It is only rotated and reduced in size:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=60710" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60710.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60710.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60710.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>And here are some outtakes:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=60717" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60717.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60717.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60717.jpg"/></a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=60714" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60714.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60714.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60714.jpg"/></a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=60712" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60712.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60712.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60712.jpg"/></a> <br/>The dropletts are sometimes not round because they vibrate when the are large enough.<br/> <br/>And finaly the setup I used:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=60711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60711.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60711.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5158/thumb/60711.jpg"/></a> <br/>Most important is a good control of the water flow. But fortuanetely I''m a chemist:)<br/> <br/>So thanx again to all of you,<br/> <br/>Jörg</td>', 'Thanx to all voters and especially all of the plenty commenters to make the image 4th place!Making the image was a hard job, but more for the shutter due to the many images that needed to be taken to get nice drops.I once did this with a wine bottle in 2002 with my A40 Acctually the A40 worked better for this job. I allways wanted to redo this and this challenge came just right.Here''s the original. It is only rotated and reduced in size:  And here are some outtakes: The dropletts are sometimes not round because they vibrate when the are large enough. And finaly the setup I used: Most important is a good control of the water flow. But fortuanetely I''m a chemist:) So thanx again to all of you, Jörg', '2004-02-16 02:58:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(581316, 58941, 5333, '<td valign="top">wow, lots of work :D</td>', 'wow, lots of work :D', '2004-02-16 03:52:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(581336, 59085, 16478, '<td valign="top">A fantastic shot and a deserved ribbon. Well done Tom</td>', 'A fantastic shot and a deserved ribbon. Well done Tom', '2004-02-16 04:39:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(581340, 58784, 3087, '<td valign="top">I see from your comments that you did indeed get a number of people referring to the previous images using similar technique, previously submitted on DPC. My feeling is that your version is very creative, as you said in your own comments, the reversing effect of the droplets completely changes the symbolism of the images and, by use of shallow DOF, the image reinforces your titular suggestion to focus on happiness. I think your ribbon is well-deserved. Too many voters here seem to believe that if they haven''t seen a technique or idea before on DPC then it must be original/ better whereas it can often mean that the photographer looks further afield than DPC archives for inspiration.</td>', 'I see from your comments that you did indeed get a number of people referring to the previous images using similar technique, previously submitted on DPC. My feeling is that your version is very creative, as you said in your own comments, the reversing effect of the droplets completely changes the symbolism of the images and, by use of shallow DOF, the image reinforces your titular suggestion to focus on happiness. I think your ribbon is well-deserved. Too many voters here seem to believe that if they haven''t seen a technique or idea before on DPC then it must be original/ better whereas it can often mean that the photographer looks further afield than DPC archives for inspiration.', '2004-02-16 05:06:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(581341, 59102, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this wasn''t more popular with other voters, since I like it so much... I think it''s stunning.</td>', 'I''m surprised this wasn''t more popular with other voters, since I like it so much... I think it''s stunning.', '2004-02-16 05:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
