(581862, 58414, 16672, '<td valign="top">Why did you add a border to this image? I don''t know what that person below is commenting about the border being uneven hummm...its the type of border you gave it make it look uneven. The color is off and it throw you when viewing even just the snow. I figure from the color it was sunset but hey you have a white balance on your camera your using a canon 10D and if you changed it for balance it would have been a lot better. The visual awkwardness geometrically comes in from the upper right hand side of the image with the semi blurred rose bud attracting a lot of attention not to mention the negative space of white. Well good try thanks for making the image.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Why did you add a border to this image? I don''t know what that person below is commenting about the border being uneven hummm...its the type of border you gave it make it look uneven. The color is off and it throw you when viewing even just the snow. I figure from the color it was sunset but hey you have a white balance on your camera your using a canon 10D and if you changed it for balance it would have been a lot better. The visual awkwardness geometrically comes in from the upper right hand side of the image with the semi blurred rose bud attracting a lot of attention not to mention the negative space of white. Well good try thanks for making the image. ', '2004-02-16 12:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
